ely. I hope I get a good yield!"6I hope I do even better in the contest next year!"~The yearly Berry Contest has begun here in Petalburg Town and berry enthusiasts are flocking in from all over the region!"mEveryone is trying their best to grow the most prolific Berry plant in hopes of winning the grand prize."xWe're joined by the organizer of the contest.\| Tell me, what is needed to get the best yield out of a Berry plant?"|Well, every gardener has their own set of tricks of course, but really it's all about watering your Berries diligently!"YYou heard it here first! Let's ask one of the locals what they think of the contest!"oHi there, you seem like you're a local trainer! Will this be your first time participating in the contest?"�That's great! As you can see, the Berry contest is at the height of its popularity and it attracts more and more newcomers year after year!"_Ah, a returning contestant! It looks like the competition is going to be fierce this year!"�I see, so you must be here to cheer on the participants. This event is just as much fun for spectators as it is for competitors!"ENow, what are your thoughts on this year's Berry contest so far?"XAs you can see, anyone can join this contest. Even first-timers are having a blast!"oAs you can see, participants absolutely love the contest. This is why they keep returning year after year!"MIt seems spectators might be having even more fun than the participants!"UThat's great! And I'm sure it will get even more fun as the competition goes on!"EThat's great!This must be why you're returning as a participant!"ZThis is great! You don't have to participate in the contest to have a good time here!"jThat's great! And I have no doubt that it will get more and more exciting as the competition goes on!"rGlad to hear it! It seems the contest if already off to a good start with a veteran like yourself in the mix."VI'm glad you're enjoying it so far. Feel free to look around as much as you want!"3Hopefully, it'll get more exciting as it goes!"WYet, you're returning as a participant. The winning prize must really be worth it!"<Ah! Berry-growing is not for everyone, that's for sure!"QNow tell me! In one word, what is your strategy for winning the competition?"[Now tell me! In one word, what is your secret trick when it comes to this competition?"LNow tell me! In one word, how would you sum up this competition so far?")\V[1008]... That really says it all!"cThis was Gabby, reporting live from Petalburg Town. We'll see you again on our next broadcast!"DThe Berry Contest has ended! It's time to announce the results!"In fourth place..."\V[5], with \V[4] points!"In third place..."In second place..."CAnd finally, the great winner of this year's berry contest...."lCongratulations to all of the contestants! We hope to see you again in the next edition of the contest!"5Petalburg Town: Where people mingle with nature."2Time flies by when you're sitting on a bench!"gThe peacefulness, the flowers... This city reminds me a lot of Santalune City in my home region..."lI'm an adventurer from the \C[1]Kalos region\C[0]. I came here while on a journey to explore the world!":Let's battle! I want to see how local trainers fight!"NWoah! You have a different style compared to the trainers where I'm from!"6Okay, I'll give you this hat from my home region!"�Actually, I have an idea! I brought way too many clothes from home and it's weighing me down, and I underestimated how much a journey like this costs."�Don't worry! I already have plenty to wear, so feel free to buy the extras off me. Let me know if anything piques your interest!" That's fine too, of course."eI have plenty of other outfits from my home region, Johto. Tell me if you see anything you like!"Hey! Where are you going?"mDon't you know? Pokémon trainers should always check out the \C[1]Gym\C[0] when they get to a new town!";I think I saw some Pokémon on the beach this morning!"]Pokémon holding a Berry will automatically hold a new one if y