 don't you think it might be a good idea to go see \V[12]?"(Great! \V[12] should be happy, too."ROh, you don't need to be shy. \V[12] has been looking forward to meeting you!";Get \V[12] to teach you what it means to be a trainer." \V[12]? Gone home, I think."KOr maybe that kid's scrabbling around in tall grass again somewhere..."NIt's a serious-looking machine. The professor must use this for research."?It's PC used for research. Better not mess around with it."3Hey there, \PN. Back so soon? You barely left!"'Oh, who's this with you, a friend?"H-hello sir, I'm Wally."=Hello there, Wally! Are you starting your adventure too?"\\PN is actually helping me get my first Pokémon. We caught a \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] together!"jThat's wonderful! It looks like a lively specimen, too. I'm sure that it will be a fantastic partner.".Make sure to always take good care of it!"@Yes, sir. \PN is actually helping me get my first Pokémon!"IThat's wonderful! I'm sure you'll find a wonderful partner Pokémon!"jI happen to have a \C[1]\V[2]\C[0] here that could use a partner to look after it. Would you like it?"F\PN was actually helping me get my first Pokémon, thank you sir!"Take good care of it!"Wally obtained a \V[2]!",Take good care of this Pokémon, Wally!"(Good luck catching Pokémon, Wally!"/It's a bunch of complex-looking equations!"{I forgot to tell \V[12]... You can simply buy \C[3]DNA Splicers\C[0] at any PokéMart. Go check out the one in Oldale Town!")It's crammed with books on Pokémon."This coffee is still hot!"*Looks like this coffee has gone cold!"K... And it was already fused! But it ran away before I could catch it.";I see, it sounds like it was an interesting encounter."Oh, hi \PN!"~This fused Pokémon that you saw may very well have been that same one that stole the \C[3]DNA Splicers\C[0] from my bag!",Or it might've been a different fusion!"ZFused Pokémon have always existed in the wild as a result of rare genetic mutations."zBut they have become increasingly common ever since \C[3]DNA Splicers\C[0] became commonplace with Pokémon trainers."5One of my goals is to study this new phenomenon."OSo, \PN, I heard that you beat \V[12] on your first try. That's excellent!"@So, \PN, I heard that you and \V[12] had a friendly battle!"^It can be hard to win against other Trainers, but I can tell that you have what it takes."<\V[12]'s been helping with my research for a long time.":\V[12] has an extensive history as a Trainer already."dHere, \PN, I ordered this for my research, but I think you should have this \C[1]Pokédex\C[0]."\PN obtained the Pokédex!"jThe Pokédex is a high-tech tool that automatically makes a record of any Pokémon you meet or catch."tEven fused Pokémon are recorded in it! Of course, there are thousands upon thousands of possible combinations.")Oh wow, \PN! You got a Pokédex too!"DThat's great! Just like me! Oh, I've got something for you too!"kIf you get more Pokémon, you can fuse them together with these new \C[3]DNA Splicers\C[0] apparently."&I've got to get my hands on some!"'I'll see you later, \PN. Bye, Dad!"Hunh? Prof. Birch?"7The prof's away on fieldwork. Ergo, he isn't here."�The prof isn't one for doing desk work. He's the type of person who would rather go outside and experience things than read about them here."SProf. Birch specializes in studying the habitats and distribution of Pokémon."jMore recently, he has also been researching wild fused Pokémon that seem to have become more common."^It's a book on Pokémon biology! It's showing a diagram of a Wurmple with Zigzagoon ears."Yes"No[G"Alors, \PN."*Ton père m'a beaucoup parlé de toi."@Je crois savoir que tu n'as pas encore ton propre Pokémon."iMais j'ai bien vu ta manière de te battre tout à l'heure, tu as fait preuve d'un grand sang-froid!"IJe pense qu'on peut le dire, tu tiens bien de ton père après tout!"sPour te remercier de m'avoir secouru, j'aimerais que tu gardes le Pokémon que tu as utilisé tout à l'heure."zSi tu travailles dur avec tes Pokémon et que tu fais preuve de rigueur, je pense que tu feras un excellent Dresseur."_J'ai aussi un enfant, \V[12], qui étudie les Pokémon tout en me donnant un coup de main."M\PN, tu ne penses pas que ce serait une bonne idée d'aller voir \V[12]?"@Parfait! Je suis sûr que ça fera très plaisir à \V[12]."=Allez! Ne sois pas timide. \V[12] a hâte de rencontrer!"ALaisse \V[12] t'apprendre ce que signifie être un dresseur."+Où est \V[12]? A la maison, je pense."^Soit à la maison, soit encore en train de fouiner dans les hautes herbes quelque part..."WCette machine a l'air compliquée. Le Professeur doit l'utiliser pour ses études."`C'est un ordinateur utilisé pour la recherche. Mieux vaut ne pas y toucher pour le moment."CHé, salut \PN. Déjà de retour? Tu viens à peine de partir!"%Oh, et qui est avec toi? Un ami?",B-Bonjour monsieur, je m'appelle Timmy."DBien le bonjour, Timmy! Tu te lances dans l'aventure toi aussi?"m\PN est en train de m'aider à capturer mon premier Pokémon. On a attrapé un \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] ensemble!"eC'est incroyable! Il a l'air en pleine forme. Je suis certain qu'il fera un excellent compagnon."+Tu dois en prendre le plus grand soin!"QOui, monsieur. \PN est en train de m'aider à capturer mon premier Pokémon!"[C'est formidable! Je suis certain que tu vas te trouver le partenaire Pokémon idéal!"|Il se trouve que j'ai ici un \C[1]\V[2]\C[0] qui aurait bien besoin de quelqu'un pour s'en occuper. Tu veux le prendre?"_\PN était justement en train de m'aider à capturer mon premier Pokémon, merci monsieur!"Prends-en bien soin!"Timmy a obtenu un \V[2]!",Prends bien soin de ce Pokémon, Timmy!"5Bonne chance pour la capture de Pokémon, Timmy!"?C'est tout un tas d'équations qui ont l'air compliquées!"�J'ai oublié de le dire à \V[12]... Tu peux tout simplement acheter des \C[3]Pointeaux ADN\C[0] dans n'importe quelle Boutique Pokémon. Va jeter un oeil à celle de Rosyères!"-C'est rempli de livres sur les Pokémon."Ce café est encore chaud!"AH! Le café a refroidi..."^... Et il était déjà fusionné! Mais il s'est sauvé avant que j'arrive à l'attraper.":Je vois, ça a dû être une rencontre intéressante."Oh, salut \PN!"|Ces Pokémon fusionnés dont tu parles, ce sont peut-être les mêmes qui ont volé les \C[3]Pointeaux ADN \C[0] de mon sac!"8Ou peut-être que c'était encore une autre fusion!"�D'après ce qu'on sait, les Pokémon fusionnés ont toujours existé à l'état sauvage dans le cadre de très rares mutations génétiques."�Mais ils sont de plus en plus courants depuis que les \C[3]Pointeaux ADN\C[0] se sont généralisés parmi les dresseurs de Pokémon."AL'un de mes objectifs est d'étudier ce nouveau phénomène."LAlors comme ça, \PN, tu as battu \V[12] du premier coup? Bravo à toi!"OAlors, \PN, j'ai entendu dire que toi et \V[12] aviez eu un combat amical!"sIl n'est pas toujours évident de l'emporter face à d'autres dresseurs, mais je sais que tu en as les moyens."8\V[12] m'aide dans mes recherches depuis longtemps."L\V[12] a aussi beaucoup d'expérience en matière de dressage Pokémon."�Tiens, \PN, j'ai commandé quelque chose sur Rézo Cadoizo pour m'aider dans mes recherches, mais je pense qu'il te conviendrait plus. Voici le \C[1]Pokédex\C[0]."\PN a obtenu le Pokédex!"}Le Pokédex est un outil ultraperformant, qui enregistre automatiquement tous les Pokémon que tu croises ou que tu attrapes."{Il enregistre aussi les Pokémon fusionnés! Bien sûr, il existe des centaines de milliers de combinaisons possibles."0Oh wouaw, \PN! Tu as un Pokédex toi aussi!"FExactement comme moi! AH! J'ai quelque chose pour toi d'ailleurs!"{Si tu obtiens d'autres Pokémon, tu pourras les fusionner grâce à ces nouveaux \C[3]Pointeaux ADN\C[0], apparemment."(Il faut absolument que j'en trouve!"&A plus tard, \PN. Au revoir Papa!"Hein? Professeur Seko?"RLe prof est parti faire du travail sur le terrain. Du coup, il n'est pas là."�Le prof n'est pas très amateur de paperasse. C'est le genre de personne qui préfère sortir et vivre les choses lui-même plutôt que de rester derrière un bureau toute la journée à lire les découvertes des autres."aLe Prof. Seko se spécialise dans l'étude des habitats et de la répartition des Pokémons."uDepuis peu, il fait des recherches sur l'apparition soudaine de nombreux Pokémon fusionnés à l'état sauvage."�C'est un livre sur la biologie des Pokémon! On y voit en exemple des schémas représentant un Chenipotte avec des oreilles de Zigzaton, c'est fascinant."Oui"Non;[G"So, \PN."3I've heard so much about you from your father.":I've heard that you don't have your own Pokémon yet."DBut the way you battled earlier, you pulled it off with aplomb!"BI guess you have your father's blood in your veins after all!"\Oh, yes. As thanks for rescuing me, I'd like you to have the Pokémon you used earlier."gIf you work with your Pokémon and gain experience, I think you'll make an extremely good Trainer."DMy kid, \V[12], is also studying Pokémon while helping me out."C\PN, don't you think it might be a good idea to go see \V[12]?"(Great! \V[12] should be happy, too."ROh, you don't need to be shy. \V[12] has been looking forward to meeting you!";Get \V[12] to teach you what it means to be a trainer." \V[12]? Gone home, I think."KOr maybe that kid's scrabbling around in tall grass again somewhere..."NIt's a serious-looking machine. The professor must use this for research."?It's PC used for research. Better not mess around with it."3Hey there, \PN. Back so soon? You barely left!"'Oh, who's this with you, a friend?"H-hello sir, I'm Wally."=Hello there, Wally! Are you starting your adventure too?"\\PN is actually helping me get my first Pokémon. We caught a \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] together!"jThat's wonderful! It looks like a lively specimen, too. I'm sure that it will be a fantastic partner.".Make sure to always take good care of it!"@Yes, sir. \PN is actually helping me get my first Pokémon!"IThat's wonderful! I'm sure you'll find a wonderful partner Pokémon!"jI happen to have a \C[1]\V[2]\C[0] here that could use a partner to look after it. Would you like it?"F\PN was actually helping me get my first Pokémon, thank you sir!"Take good care of it!"Wally obtained a \V[2]!",Take good care of this Pokémon, Wally!"(Good luck catching Pokémon, Wally!"/It's a bunch of complex-looking equations!"{I forgot to tell \V[12]... You can simply buy \C[3]DNA Splicers\C[0] at any PokéMart. Go check out the one in Oldale Town!")It's crammed with books on Pokémon."This coffee is still hot!"*Looks like this coffee has gone cold!"K... And it was already fused! But it ran away before I could catch it.";I see, it sounds like it was an interesting encounter."Oh, hi \PN!"~This fused Pokémon that you saw may very well have been that same one that stole the \C[3]DNA Splicers\C[0] from my bag!",Or it might've been a different fusion!"ZFused Pokémon have always existed in the wild as a result of rare genetic mutations."zBut they have become increasingly common ever since \C[3]DNA Splicers\C[0] became commonplace with Pokémon trainers."5One of my goals is to study this new phenomenon."OSo, \PN, I heard that you beat \V[12] on your first try. That's excellent!"@So, \PN, I heard that you and \V[12] had a friendly battle!"^It can be hard to win against other Trainers, but I can tell that you have what it takes."<\V[12]'s been helping with my research for a long time.":\V[12] has an extensive history as a Trainer already."dHere, \PN, I ordered this for my research, but I think you should have this \C[1]Pokédex\C[0]."\PN obtained the Pokédex!"jThe Pokédex is a high-tech tool that automatically makes a record of any Pokémon you meet or catch."tEven fused Pokémon are recorded in it! Of course, there are thousands upon thousands of possible combinations.")Oh wow, \PN! You got a Pokédex too!"DThat's great! Just like me! Oh, I've got something for you too!"kIf you get more Pokémon, you can fuse them together with these new \C[3]DNA Splicers\C[0] apparently."&I've got to get my hands on some!"'I'll see you later, \PN. Bye, Dad!"Hunh? Prof. Birch?"7The prof's away on fieldwork. Ergo, he isn't here."�The prof isn't one for doing desk work. He's the type of person who would rather go outside and experience things than read about them here."SProf. Birch specializes in studying the habitats and distribution of Pokémon."jMore recently, he has also been researching wild fused Pokémon that seem to have become more common."^It's a book on Pokémon biology! It's showing a diagram of a Wurmple with Zigzagoon ears."Yes"NoIu;␀y[["*Oh another new trainer! Let's battle!"
