yagou"_While you're not in a battle, Pokémon can remember any of the moves they've known before."'Hello there, I'm the Move Teacher."<I know every single move that Pokemon learn growing up."<\GFor $500, I can teach a move to one of your Pokémon."\GWhat do you think?"#Which Pokémon needs tutoring?"@If your Pokémon need to learn a move, come back to see me!"<Huh? There isn't a single move that I can teach an Egg."Sorry..."GIt doesn't appear as if I have any move I can teach to your \v[3]."-Which move should I teach to your \v[3]?"!\G\PN paid $500 in exchange."@\GIf your Pokémon need to learn a move, come back anytime!")Oh, but you don't have enough money!"...And done!"BOkay, nurse. Everything's ready. It should be all set up now!"/Oh, I'm sorry. Are you a Pokémon Trainer?"mI'm Lanette, I'm a computer expert! I just finished installing a new feature to the Pokémon Center PCs."-I call it... The \C[1]Transfer Box\C[0]!"�It's a special box that can be installed in your PC that allows you to freely transfer Pokémon with trainers all the way in the \C[1]Kanto region\C[0]!"FWell, that's the plan anyway, I still need to talk to Bill first."5That's something that interests you, am I right?"I knew it!"?Well, it's already installed if you want to give it a try!"=It should be the very last box in your Pokémon Storage."[Well, I better get going. I need to make sure it's installed in every Pokémon Center!"Maybe I'll see you around!"pHave you been able to get your hands on DNA Splicers yet? I heard they can make your Pokémon super strong!"@There is an old fisherman that lives just outside the city."ISometimes he offers to ferry trainers between here and Dewford Town."UIf you rematch a trainer enough, they'll surely want to trade Pokémon with you!"FRare Pokémon show up under the Cycling Road when it's foggy out!"`If you catch more Pokémon than you can hold, you can retrieve them from the PC over there!"YSomeone put up some red tents up North. Who would want to camp in a place l