 us?"#Spheal wants to play with you!"There's too many Krabby!"8Maybe we can find a Krabby to play with us now too!"!Arghh... Nothing's biting..."/\C[2]Team Magma\C[0] has gone too far now!"}Not only did they set up camp North of the Slateport City, but they had the audacity to paint their logo all over the city..."JThey even painted one right inside the ferry terminal, of all places!"@Slateport City is Team Aqua's turf, and it always will be!!"aGahh I'm so angry! I'd go cover them up right away if Shelly hadn't stuck me with deck duty!"KHey, you're a new recruit, aren't you? Why don't you go instead of me?"9Take this and cover up all of their logos with ours!"TWhoa! If Shelly sees you not wearing your uniform, you'll be walking the plank!"&Hahah, yes! You covered them all!"INow everyone will know that you can't mess with \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0]!"WA job well done deserves a reward! I found all this money while sweeping the deck.";I wanted to keep it all, but I'll give you some of it."lThey even painted their logo right inside the harbor, of all places! Slateport is our city, not theirs!"nI counted 5 graffiti in total. Let's paint over them and show Team Magma who this town really belongs to!"0Our logo is called the \C[1]Amazing A\C[0]!"_Do you think that the A stands for Aqua or for Archie? Heh! The answer might surprise you!"-Seashore House: Come quench your thirst!""Huh? Who let you in our camp?"!Arghh! It's two against one!")So, ye want to sail to Dewford Town?"0Come find me when you're ready to set sail!"%Ahoy! We've hit land in Dewford."%Shelly... It's been a long time."[Tabitha... I guess Devon Corp finally got the memo and decided to get rid of you, huh?"7That was a long time ago! I'm with Team Magma now!"bStop messing around! Our drill needs that Pressure Regulator from the \C[1]Devon Parts\C[0] ."KWe know that \PN gave them to you after we left at the Oceanic Museum!"vWe don't have them, you numbskull! And even if we did, I'd sooner toss them into the ocean than hand them to you!"*\PN, get ready! Let's take them down!"Humph..."LI guess you really don't have those \C[1]Devon Parts \C[0] after all..."[It's a small hiccup, but Maxie's always ten steps ahead. He's already onto a new lead."Grunts!"/Follow me! Retreat and regroup with Maxie!")Is it... Snowing in Slateport City?!"<Ah! The sun is out and it's such a beautiful day today!"HDo you want to sit and soak up the sun with us to work on your tan?"pGreat! You can sit on the chair over there. There's nothing like a little sunshine to recharge your energy!"Aww, you're no fun!"HWow! Your suntan... it's perfect! You really soaked in the sun too!"NAh, do you feel it, Sunkern? The sun has me feeling completely energized."Flaaah!",Oh, wow! The sun really charged you up!"-I guess I won't need this anymore, then!"9Oh... The weather turned, it's not so sunny anymore."8I'm sure it'll turn again. Let's wait a little bit!")There! The weather is perfect again!"Your suntan..."lIt's a little bit better, but it can still be improved. You should sit out in the sun for a bit longer!"/Being out in the sun is good for the body!"(Your Pokémon is no match for ours!" You cannot stop Team Magma!"RIf you're not with \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0], you've got no business here. Go away!"HHuh? Archie told you to come here? You must be something special..."|Well, Archie's already gone. \C[1]Shelly \C[0]'s the one in command in this camp now, so you'll want to talk to her instead."BI think she's near the boat. Be quick and don't snoop around!"You can have this!"
