web instead of working!">It's an in-depth Wiki about Pokémon Fusion. Have a look?"'Devon Corporation: A Brief History"jDevon Corporation was initially founded by Mr. Stone as a mining company operating in northern Hoenn."eIt was Mr. Stone's love for fossils and minerals that made the company grow into what it is now."�The company rapidly diversified their operations into researching new technologies and is now considered the most influential company in Hoenn."#<o=100><fs=16>Whee...</fs></o>"2<fs=32><outln2><b>SQUAWK!!!!</b></outln></fs>"NMr. Stone found a Lileep fossil while digging in his backyard as a child."rThis is what gave him his love for Pokémon fossils and inspired him to found this company later in his life."mThere's a lot to learn about Pokémon fusion! You can look up what you need on the classroom's computer."kI have a lot of questions about our wonderful Hoenn Region, and it seems a lot of others have as well."5Thankfully, this book contains loads of answers!"DHuh? What's that, Whismur? Are you trying to tell me something?"#Ugh... I can't hear a thing..."CWhismur's whispers are so soft, I can barely hear them at all!"\It's not its fault, of course, but maybe I should fuse it with something that's louder."WOh! What about a \C[1]Wingull\C[0]? They're pretty loud, so it should average out."(Do you think you could find me one?"3Maybe that's not such a good idea after all..."CHey! Did you find a \C[1]Wingull\C[0] to fuse with my Whismur?"mIf I fuse Whismur with something loud like a Wingull, I should be able to hear what it wants to tell me!"!\PN handed over the Wingull."Okay, Whismur. Here we go!"<b>Squawk!</b>",It worked, I can hear it perfectly now!"8Now, what is it that you've been trying to tell me?""<b>Squawk squawk! Squawk!</b>"Oh! I get it now!"PYou want the \C[1]Rare Candies\C[0] I was keeping in the fridge! Of course!"&Here you go, little buddy. Enjoy!"Uhh...."Oh my...":<fs=32><outln2><b>SQUAWK SQUAWK!!!! </b></outln></fs>""Oh no, this is much too loud!"6I need to get some earplugs! This was a bad idea!"1Please, take this last \C[1]Rare Candy\C[0]!"9I hope my neighbours don't file a noise complaint..."$There's an email on the screen:"�"The preliminary analysis on the meteorite you sent me shows that it emits powerful fusion energy, equal to thousands of DNA Splicers, maybe more.""�"This could be very dangerous if it fell in the wrong hands. I will need to keep it here in Fallarbor Town a bit longer for further analysis."\n- Professor Cozmo"ZIt's an in-depth book containing frequently asked questions about Hoenn. Have a look?"9Huh? Oh, I'm sorry. This area is for employees only."Piuhh!"nIt's tapping it's wand against the blackboard, seemingly wanting you to read what's written on the board."'We learned about evolutions today!"RDid you know that fused Pokémon evolve at the same time as unfused Pokémon?"FI specialize in restoring Pokémon fossils to their former glory."*If you have a fossil, bring it to me!"=Let me know when you want us to revive a fossil for you."ROh, I'm sorry, but our fossil reviving machine cannot extract DNA from amber."qYou'll have to go to a more sophisticated laboratory for that, like the one in Cinnabar Island for instance."/Okay. I'll see if I can revive your \v[3]."<Come back around \V[85]:00. It should be ready by then."}Oh \PN, I'm so sorry to have to tell you that, but your fossil has been irreversably damaged during the reviving fossil."NUnfortunately, it doesn't look like there is any chance of recovering it.">Where have you been? We've finished reviving your fossil."'It was \v[3], just like I thought."RYou have no room left. Use the PC over there to make some room and come back!"5It'll take a little while to revive your fossil.">Come back at about \V[85]:00. It should be ready by then."CThere's just too many combinations. I can't remember them all!"RI heard there's a secret clearing with rare Pokémon deep in Petalburg woods."I just have to find it!"
