o participate in Wonder Trades in Pokémon Centers."=You can get Pokémon from all around the world that way!"1Hello, and welcome to the Devon Corporation."GWe produce all kinds of items and medicine that enhance your life."Meooww!"aIf you find a Pokémon fossil somewhere, you can bring it to Devon Corp to have it examined."SThe Gym Leader, Roxanne, knows a lot about Pokémon. She's really strong, too!"S...As I was saying outside, Devon Corporation is Hoenn's largest tech company."SWe started off as a simple mining company years ago, and now we do everything."PTrainer products, new technologies, energy, space exploration, you name it!"rWe even do research on Pokémon fusion! In fact, all of those fields are more connected than one might think."a\PN, I must thank you for helping me, not once, but twice. You really are a special trainer!";Now, I want you to know I'm a president you can trust."CTo thank you for helping me, I want to give you this for free!"pAs long as this is on, any experience you obtain during Pokémon battles will go towards your entire party."7This should help a lot for training your Pokémon."LMr. Stone, there's a call for you from Mossdeep Space Center on Line 1." Mossdeep Space Center, huh?"@Excuse me \PN, I have to take this. It'll just be a moment."Hello? Mr. Stone speaking."Hmm..."Oh no!!""And are you completely sure??"VIt was only supposed to pass by! Double check your calculations! This can't be..."[...Very well... I'll send them the parts. Let's hope there is still time to prepare..."TI'm sorry about that, \PN... That was... Umm... Nothing for you to worry about.",Although, I do have a favor to ask you."[Those parts you recovered are an important component for a... uh... vital new project."YCould I get you to deliver it to the \C[1]Shipyard\C[0] in \C[1]Slateport City\C[0]?",Please, I will repay you for the favor."KThank you! You'll have to cross the sea to reach Slateport, of course."{I'll ask \C[1]Mr. Briney\C[0], the old sailor who lives i