Kahh!"yI'm sorry to ask so much of you, but please deliver the Devon Parts to Captain Stern at the Slateport City Shipyard."vAnd deliver the letter to my son Steven on the way there. You should find him in Granite Cave, near Dewford Town."DDevon's president and his son both like to collect rare stones."Bahwk!"Chiah!"xCutting through wood with sharp claws like it's nothing, that's something only a well-trained Pokémon can achieve."=That determined expression... The limber way you move..."(You're obviously a skilled trainer!"tProve it to me. Defeat my sharp-clawed Pokémon in a battle and I'll hand you my \C[1]secret HM technique.\C[0]"+Aiyahh! Show me how deserving you are!"`Ah yes, you and your Pokémon possess the spirit of a woodcutter! Take my secret technique!"lTeach this HM to one of your Pokémon. It will allow you to cut small trees that might block your path."2Feel free to test it out on these trees here."2Your Pokémon might not be ready after all..."oTeach the Cut HM to one of your Pokémon. It will allow you to cut small trees that might block your path."KI saw a green Marill by the pond, but my big brother won't believe me!"BI swear it's true! It was just past that \C[1]Cut Tree \C[0]!"=Can you please try to find it and show it to my brother?"7I swear it's true! It was just past that Cut Tree!"GGreen Marills are so much cooler than the blue ones, do you agree?"+My daddy works at Devon. He made this!",But I can't use it, so you can have it."1When I grow up, I want to work at Devon too!"(It's a collection of rare minerals!"FWhen they were expanding the city of Rustboro, my dad helped out."GHe made his Pokémon use \C[1]Cut\C[0] to clear the land of trees."3All Marill are blue, and that's the end of it!"*I guess some Marill can be green too."gThere's a database filled with pictures of fused Pokémon on the computer. What? No public access?"?Way back in the day, Devon was just a teeny, tiny company."[Looks like the employee at this computer has been browsing the web instead of working!">It's an in-depth Wiki about Pokémon Fusion. Have a look?"'Devon Corporation: A Brief History"jDevon Corporation was initially founded by Mr. Stone as a mining company operating in northern Hoenn."eIt was Mr. Stone's love for fossils and minerals that made the company grow into what it is now."�The company rapidly diversified their operations into researching new technologies and is now considered the most influential company in Hoenn."#<o=100><fs=16>Whee...</fs></o>"2<fs=32><outln2><b>SQUAWK!!!!</b></outln></fs>"NMr. Stone found a Lileep fossil while digging in his backyard as a child."rThis is what gave him his love for Pokémon fossils and inspired him to found this company later in his life."mThere's a lot to learn about Pokémon fusion! You can look up what you need on the classroom's computer."kI have a lot of questions about our wonderful Hoenn Region, and it seems a lot of others have as well."5Thankfully, this book contains loads of answers!"DHuh? What's that, Whismur? Are you trying to tell me something?"#Ugh... I can't hear a thing..."CWhismur's whispers are so soft, I can barely hear them at all!"\It's not its fault, of course, but maybe I should fuse it with something that's louder."WOh! What about a \C[1]Wingull\C[0]? They're pretty loud, so it should average out."(Do you think you could find me one?"3Maybe that's not such a good idea after all..."CHey! Did you find a \C[1]Wingull\C[0] to fuse with my Whismur?"mIf I fuse Whismur with something loud like a Wingull, I should be able to hear what it wants to tell me!"!\PN handed over the Wingull."Okay, Whismur. Here we go!"<b>Squawk!</b>",It worked, I can hear it perfectly now!"8Now, what is it that you've been trying to tell me?""<b>Squawk squawk! Squawk!</b>"Oh! I get it now!"PYou want the \C[1]Rare Candies\C[0] I was keeping in the fridge! Of course!"&Here you go, little buddy. Enjoy!"Uhh...."Oh my...":<fs=32><outln2><b>SQUAWK SQUAWK!!!! </b></outln></fs>""Oh no, this is much too loud!"6I need to get some earplugs! This was a bad idea!"1Please, take this last \C[1]Rare Candy\C[0]!"9I hope my neighbours don't file a noise complaint..."$There's an email on the screen:"�"The preliminary analysis on the meteorite you sent me shows that it emits powerful fusion energy, equal to thousands of DNA Splicers, maybe more.""�"This could be very dangerous if it fell in the wrong hands. I will need to keep it here in Fallarbor Town a bit longer for further analysis."\n- Professor Cozmo"ZIt's an in-depth book containing frequently asked questions about Hoenn. Have a look?"9Huh? Oh, I'm sorry. This area is for employees only."Piuhh!"nIt's tapping it's wand against the blackboard, seemingly wanting you to read what's written on the board."'We learned about evolutions today!"RDid you know that fused Pokémon evolve at the same time as unfused Pokémon?"FI specialize in restoring Pokémon fossils to their former glory."*If you have a fossil, bring it to me!"=Let me know when you want us to revive a fossil for you."ROh, I'm sorry, but our fossil reviving machine cannot extract DNA from amber."qYou'll have to go to a more sophisticated laboratory for that, like the one in Cinnabar Island for instance."/Okay. I'll see if I can revive your \v[3]."<Come back around \V[85]:00. It should be ready by then."}Oh \PN, I'm so sorry to have to tell you that, but your fossil has been irreversably damaged during the reviving fossil."NUnfortunately, it doesn't look like there is any chance of recovering it.">Where have you been? We've finished reviving your fossil."'It was \v[3], just like I thought."RYou have no room left. Use the PC over there to make some room and come back!"5It'll take a little while to revive your fossil.">Come back at about \V[85]:00. It should be ready by then."CThere's just too many combinations. I can't remember them all!"RI heard there's a secret clearing with rare Pokémon deep in Petalburg woods."I just have to find it!"
Meoh!"oI can't identify this new fossil I found. It looks a bit like a dome, but it's also shaped like a helix..."`Could it be the fossil of a Kabuto and Omanyte fusion? Huh, I don't know if that's right..."KSome wild Pokémon will shy away or freeze up when they see a trainer."TOthers are curious and will come closer to investigate, or even charge at them!"PA detailed book all about fossil identification. It seems very complicated."�Attack, Defense and Speed are the \C[1]Physical stats\C[0]. They are passed down more effectively in fusions by the \C[1]Body Pokémon\C[0]."�Special Attack, Special Defense and HP are the \C[1]Special stats\C[0]. They are passed down more effectively in fusions by the \C[1]Head Pokémon\C[0]."YWhat were these Pokémon thinking... Why would they want to fuse together like this?"1Oh, hi. I do research on Pokémon behaviors."�I'm trying to get a better understanding of what pushes wild Pokémon to fuse together in the wild, but I don't have enough data."zI've caught a glimpse of it once. Two Pokémon attacked me at once, but just before battling me, they fused together!"vWas it a conscious decision? An involuntary reflex? That's what I'm trying to figure out... But I need more data!"jCould you please go out and see if you can get wild Pokémon to fuse together before they battle you?"tExcellent! To make sure that I have enough data, we would need to see it happen \C[1]at least three times\C[0]."(Now go and gather some data for me!"b\C[2]NOTICE: This quest can only be completed with the "Overworld Encounters" option enabled."&Are you back from gathering data?"SWow! It happened the same way each time. This confirms that it wasn't a fluke!"]I see... Maybe the Pokémon felt the need to fuse together because they felt threatened?"sThere's still much to learn, but I feel like I'm getting a better understanding of how Pokémon think already."&Thank you! Here's for helping me."yI've caught a glimpse of it once. Two Pokémon attacked me at once but just before battling me, they fused together!"`Please go out and see if you can get wild Pokémon to fuse together before they battle you."NWe would need to see it happen three different times to have enough data."5Devon Corp develops all kinds of new technology!"IMy dream is to create a device that allows us to talk with Pokémon."JUnderstanding Pokémon behavior is a large part of catching Pokémon!"LStudents who don't study get a little taste of my \C[1]Quick Claw\C[0]."ZWhether or not you are a good student will be evident from the way you use this item."fA Pokémon holding the Quick Claw will occasionally speed up and get to move before its opponent."FThere are many other items that are meant to be held by Pokémon."9Just those alone will give you many topics to study."YA fusion can learn all of the moves of both its Body Pokémon and its Head Pokémon."	Mah!"(Clefairy is tapping the blackboard!"Piuh piuh!"Piuh piuh piuh!!!"0Clefairy reached out to hand you something."Piuh..."DFusions inherit the ability of either one of its base Pokémon."[I hear that Mr. Stone, the president of Devon Corp. is obsessed with Pokémon Fossils!""Heya! Do you have a PokéNav?"KI've been working on this app for it. Here, let me install it for you!"RIt's a music app! Use it to listen to your favorite tracks wherever you want!"SWhat do you think of the Jukebox App on your PokéNav? Have you been using it?"Yes"NoIu;␀�[[$"What do you want?"(Can't you see we're busy? Get lost!"!I'm working, leave me alone!"aThe beach, the fresh air... This city reminds me a lot of Cianwood City in my home region..."lI'm an adventurer from the \C[1]Johto region\C[0]. I came here while on a journey to explore the world!":Let's battle! I want to see how local trainers fight!"NWoah! You have a different style compared to the trainers where I'm from!"6Okay, I'll give you this hat from my home region!"�Actually, I have an idea! I brought way too many clothes from home and it's weighing me down, and I underestimated how much a journey like this costs."�Don't worry! I already have plenty to wear, so feel free to buy the extras off me. Let me know if anything piques your interest!"Oh, okay then."eI have plenty of other outfits from my home region, Johto. Tell me if you see anything you like!"	Hey!"NHey, you there in the cave! Come over here, we wanna have a small chat..."RSo... You were with that Steven guy in the cave, huh? Mind if we have a chat?"IFufufu... What's with that look? I'm just a bit curious, that's all!"HAnd don't even think of lying! We saw him walk out just before you!"]That Steven... He's a pretty famous guy, you know. Son of the Devon president and all..."=A guy like that has got to know a lot of useful intel..."|Speaking of intel, we caught wind that some \C[1]Devon Parts\C[0] we've been searching for are being shipped to Slateport...";Did that Steven guy tell you about anything like that?"Heh, so it is true, then."Heh, is that so?"CWell I guess we'll have to go and check it out ourselves then."9Alright, no time to waste. Let's head for Slateport!"Yes"No"Browse clothes"Browse hats"Browse hairstyles"Never mind[$"Tu veux quoi?":Tu vois pas qu'on est occupés là? Va voir ailleurs!"%Je bosse là, fiche-moi la paix!"VLa plage, l'air frais... Cette ville me rappelle Irisia dans ma région natale..."|Je suis originaire de la \C[1]région de Johto\C[0]. Je suis de passage ici dans mon projet d'explorer le monde entier!"UBattons-nous! J'ai envie de voir ce que les dresseurs locaux ont dans le ventre!"KWoah! Tu as un style de combat différent des dresseurs de ma région!"4Ok, je vais te donner ce chapeau de ma région!"�En fait, j'ai une idée! J'ai emporté beaucoup trop de vêtements de chez moi et ça me pèse trop lourd, et j'ai aussi sous-estimé le coût d'un tel voyage."�Ne t'inquiète pas! J'ai déjà plein de vêtements à porter, alors n'hésite pas à m'en acheter plus. Dis-moi si quelque chose t'intéresse!"Ah, d'accord alors.."tJ'ai pleins d'autres vêtements de J