! I'm going to do it right now!"...Here I go!"/Woah! I can't believe how much it changed!";My very own fusion! I will always, always treasure it!";I hope we'll meet again, \PN. And you too, Mr. Norman!"3Hmm. That boy will be worth keeping an eye on."But for now..."C\PN, if you want to become a strong trainer, here's my advice."7Head for \C[1]Rustboro City\C[0] beyond this town."CThere, you should challenge the Gym Leader, \C[1]Roxanne\C[0]."FAfter her, go on to other Pokémon Gyms and defeat their leaders."4Collect \C[1]badges\C[0] from them, understood?"AOf course, I'm a Gym Leader, too. We'll battle one day, \PN."/But that's only after you become stronger.Iu;␀V[["$It's a Pokémon egg... Take it?"Obtained a Pokémon egg!"5You have no room in your party to store the egg."#It's an empty Pokémon nest..."Yes"No["-C'est un oeuf de Pokémon... Le prendre?"&Tu as obtenu un oeuf de Pokémon!"EVous n'avez pas de place dans votre équipe pour stocker l'oeuf.""C'est un nid Pokémon vide..."Oui"Non;["$It's a Pokémon egg... Take it?"Obtained a Pokémon egg!"5You have no room in your party to store the egg."#It's an empty Pokémon nest..."Yes"NoIu;␀i[[."^Do you have an \C[1]Oricorio\C[0]? I heard that some can be found behind the flower shop."3Oh, that Oricorio in your team is so precious!"fDid you know? Oricorio can change form when it drinks the nectar from flowers like the ones here!"iThere are 4 types of nectar flowers: \C[5]pink\C[0], \C[6]yellow\C[0], \C[2]red\C[0], and \C[1]blue."JI'll give you something if you show me Oricorio in each of its forms!"Oh! That's a \C[2]Baile style Oricorio!\C[0] It transforms into this form after drinking some \C[2]red flower nectar\C[0]."QThis flower's nectar is a bit spicy... They brings out the fire in Oricorio!"%Here, you can have some of this."�This is a sample of the nectar that Oricorio drank to transform into the Baile form. You can use this to change its form anywhere!"Oh! That's a \C[6]Pom-Pom style Oricorio!\C[0] It transforms into this form after drinking some \C[6]yellow flower nectar\C[0]."UThis flower's nectar is very sour... It makes Oricorio crackle with electricity!"[This is a sample of the nectar that Oricorio drank to transform into the Pom-Pom form."2You can use this to change its form anywhere!"Oh! That's a \C[5]Pa'u style Oricorio!\C[0] It transforms into this form after drinking some \C[5]pink flower nectar\C[0]."OThis flower's nectar tastes gently sweet... It sharpens Oricorio's senses!"�This is a sample of the nectar that Oricorio drank to transform into the Pa'u form. You can use this to change its form anywhere!"{Oh! That's a \C[1]Sensu style Oricorio!\C[0] It transforms into this form after drinking some \C[1]blue flower nectar\C[0]."WThis flower's nectar is very bitter... It awakens the mysterious side of Oricorio!"�This is a sample of the nectar that Oricorio drank to transform into the Sensu form. You can use this to change its form anywhere!">That's it, those are all of the different Oricorio forms!"eYou can buy some more nectar from me if you want. It's useful if you can't find a flower nearby!"@And you can even use nectar to change forms during battles!"wWould you like to purchase some nectar? It can be used to change Oricorio's form when there isn't a flower nearby!"FIt's bouquet of red flowers! They give off a warm, tingling aroma"{Oh, these flowers only produce their special nectar when they're in the wild. You won't get any from the ones in here!";It's bouquet of yellow flowers. They smell a bit sour!"WHello! This is the Pretty Petal flower shop. Spreading flowers all over the world!"0\PN, would you like to learn about Berries?"@Berries grow on trees that thrive only in soft, loamy soil."LIf you take some Berries, be sure to plant one in the loamy soil again."WI want to see the whole wide world filled with beautiful flowers. That's my dream."gPlease help me achieve my dream and plant all the Berries you can find. Then water them with this!"6Flowers bring so much happiness, don't you think?"NMake sure to use some fertilizer if you want your Berries to grow faster."EIt's bouquet of blue flowers! They have a slightly strong smell."EThe more attention you give to plants, the more they reward you."Try to plant this one!"BIf you water them diligently, the more Berries they'll yield."HIt's bouquet of pink flowers. They give off a slightly sweet aroma!"Yes"No[."hMais! Vous avez un \C[1]Plumeline\C[0]? J'ai entendu dire qu'on en trouvait derrière le fleuriste."@Ouah! Ce Plumeline dans votre équipe est tellement mignon!"|Je ne sais pas si tu es au courant, mais Plumeline peut changer de forme lorsqu'il boit le nectar de fleurs comme celles-ci!"~Il existe 4 types de fleurs qui donnent ces nectars: \C[5]roses\C[0], \C[6]jaunes\C[0], \C[2]rouges\C[0], et \C[1]bleues."PJe te donnerai quelque chose si tu me montres un Plumeline de chaque forme!"wMais! C'est un \C[2]Plumeline Style Flamenco\C[0]! Il prend cette forme après avoir bu du \C[2]Nectar Rouge\C[0]."]Le nectar de cette fleur est un peu épicé… Il fait monter la tension chez Plumeline!"Tiens, prends-en un peu."�Voici un échantillon du nectar que Plumeline a bu pour prendre la forme de style Flamenco. Tu peux l'utiliser pour changer de forme où tu veux!"vHein! C'est un \C[6]Plumeline Style Pom-Pom\C[0]! Il prend cette forme après avoir bu du \C[6]Nectar Jaune\C[0]."]Le nectar de cette fleur est très iodé… Il fait crépiter Plumeline d'électricité!"VVoici un échantillon du nectar que Plumeline a bu pour prendre sa forme Pom-Pom."=Tu peux t'en servir pour changer sa forme n'importe où!"qOh.. C'est un \C[5]Plumeline Style Hula!\C[0] Il prend cette forme après avoir bu du \C[5]Nectar Rose\C[0]."`Le nectar de cette fleur a un goût étonnament sucré… Il aiguise les sens de Plumeline!"�Voici un échantillon du nectar que Plumeline a bu pour prendre la forme de style Hula. Tu peux l'utiliser pour changer de forme où tu veux!"rWah! C'est un \C[1]Plumeline Style Buyō!\C[0] Il prend cette forme après avoir bu du \C[1]Nectar Bleu\C[0]."_Le nectar de cette fleur est très amer... Il éveille le côté mystérieux de Plumeline."�Ceci est un échantillon du nectar que Plumeline a bu pour prendre le Style Buyō. Vous pouvez l'utiliser pour changer sa forme n'importe où!"DEt voilà. Ce sont toutes les différentes formes de Plumeline!"jTu peux m'acheter davantage de nectar si tu veux. Pratique quand il n'y a pas de fleur à proximité!"[De plus, tu peux utiliser ce nectar pour changer de forme même au milieu d'un combat!"fVeux-tu acheter du nectar? Il sert à changer la forme de Plumeline même en l'absence de fleurs!"XC'est un bouquet de fleurs rouges! Elles dégagent un parfum chaleureux et enivrant"Oh, ces fleurs ne peuvent produire leur nectar si spécial que dans la nature. Tu n'obtiendras rien de celles qui poussent ici!"DC'est un bouquet de fleurs jaunes. Leur odeur est un peu aigre!"SBonjour! Voici le Fleuriste Jolie Fleur. Vive les fleurs, plantons-en partout!"6\PN, voulez-vous en apprendre plus sur les Baies?"]Les baies poussent sur des arbres qui ne prospèrent que dans un sol meuble et argileux."NSi vous cueillez des Baies, n'oubliez pas d'en replanter une dans le sol."RJe voudrais voir le monde entier recouvert de belles fleurs. C'est mon rêve!"{Je t'en prie, aide-moi à réaliser mon rêve et plante toutes les baies que tu trouves. Ensuite, arrose-les avec ça!"?Les fleurs nous apportent tant de joie, tu ne trouves pas?"^N'oubliez pas d'ajouter un peu d'engrais si vous voulez que les baies poussent plus vite."=C'est un bouquet de fleurs bleues! Elles sentent fort..."CSi tu prends bien soin de tes plantes, elles te le revaudront."Essaye de planter ça!"MSi tu les arroses quotidiennement, elles donneront encore plus de Baies."VC'est un bouquet de fleurs roses. Elles dégagent un parfum délicatement sucré!"Oui"Non;[."^Do you have an \C[1]Oricorio\C[0]? I heard that some can be found behind the flower shop."3Oh, that Oricorio in your team is so precious!"fDid you know? Oricorio can change form when it drinks the nectar from flowers like the ones here!"iThere are 4 types of nectar flowers: \C[5]pink\C[0], \C[6]yellow\C[0], \C[2]red\C[0], and \C[1]blue."JI'll give you something if you show me Oricorio in each of its forms!"Oh! That's a \C[2]Baile style Oricorio!\C[0] It transforms into this form after drinking some \C[2]red flower nectar\C[0]."QThis flower's nectar is a bit spicy... They brings out the fire in Oricorio!"%Here, you can have some of this."�This is a sample of the nectar that Oricorio drank to transform into the Baile form. You can use this to change its form anywhere!"Oh! That's a \C[6]Pom-Pom style Oricorio!\C[0] It transforms into this form after drinking some \C[6]yellow flower nectar\C[0]."UThis flower's nectar is very sour... It makes Oricorio crackle with electricity!"[This is a sample of the nectar that Oricorio drank to transform into the Pom-Pom form."2You can use this to change its form anywhere!"Oh! That's a \C[5]Pa'u style Oricorio!\C[0] It transforms into this form after drinking some \C[5]pink flower nectar\C[0]."OThis flower's nectar tastes gently sweet... It sharpens Oricorio's senses!"�This is a sample of the nectar that Oricorio drank to transform into the Pa'u form. You can use this to change its form anywhere!"{Oh! That's a \C[1]Sensu style Oricorio!\C[0] It transforms into this form after drinking some \C[1]blue flower nectar\C[0]."WThis flower's nectar is very bitter... It awakens the mysterious side of Oricorio!"�This is a sample of the nectar that Oricorio drank to transform into the Sensu form. You can use this to change its form anywhere!">That's it, those are all of the different Oricorio forms!"eYou can buy some more nectar from me if you want. It's useful if you can't find a flower nearby!"@And you can even use nectar to change forms during battles!"wWould you like to purchase some nectar? It can be used to change Oricorio's form when there isn't a 