 can be so funny!"�Hi there! I collect Heart Scales from seashells on the beach and craft them into \C[1]Glimmer Coins\C[0] that can be used to buy clothes."/Do you have \C[1]Heart Scales\C[0] for me?"FIf you find some, bring them to me and I'll convert them for you!"AHave you been using the PokéChallenge app on your PokéNav?"RI don't mean to brag, but I've completed even more than the chairman himself!"IWhat about you? Let's see... You've completed \V[1] PokéChallenges."	Wha-"5You've somehow surpassed me! I don't believe it!"Such a feat deserves a great reward. Here, take this to show everyone that you're the uncontested PokéChallenge champion!"8Clearly I have no chance of catching up to you now!"'Woah, that's an impressive number!"Okay, you've earned this!"bDo you think you can beat my record? Come and see me if you can complete 100 PokéChallenges!"*Woah, you've really been going at it!"&Here's something for your effort!"fCome and see me again once you've completed 50 PokéChallenges. I'll have something else for you!"5Not bad! You're really getting the hang of this!"fCome and see me again once you've completed 25 PokéChallenges. I'll have something else for you!"[Come and see me once you've completed 10 PokéChallenges. I'll have something for you!"QOh, you haven't completed any challenges yet! Go out and get your first one!"VI'll give you something as a bit of encouragement if you can complete 10 of them!".What!? You don't have the app installed!?"4You need to go talk to the chairman right away!"Yes"No[>"�Je voulais aller à la plage l'autre jour, mais il s'est mis à pleuvoir alors j'ai rassemblé mes affaires pour rentrer chez moi."0J'aime tous les Pokémon, bien évidemment."eMais celui que j'aime le plus au monde, c'est \C[1]Kirlia \C[0]. Oh, si seulement j'en avait un!"TSi tu as un Kirlia, tu voudrais bien me l'échanger contre mon \C[1]Riolu\C[0]?"(J'ai enfin mon propre \V[2]! Merci!"7Je suppose que mon échange ne t'intéresse pas..."�Maintenant que j'ai un 