\V[2]"That's true!"$Not yet! Please don't spoil it!"9Hey, have you seen the new episode of Hoenn Rangers?"PI have to say, it was one of the best episodes of the entire series so far!"EOh without a doubt! It was so much better than the previous one!"I never saw it coming!"8I want to watch it tonight, don't tell me anything!"�Oh, that was such a strange one. Having the rangers help a struggling film producer write a film based on their exploits felt strangely meta..."EYeah, I'm not too sure where they're going with that plotline..."@Please do not enter the studio when filming is in progress."&Mauville Tourism Information Desk"UI'm the weatherman here at Mauville TV! Have you tuned in to our channel before?"vI work closely with the Weather Institute to get the most accurate readings on the weather for the entire region!"nWe even have an app that you can install on your PokéNav to check the weather on the go. Do you want it?"Here you go!"4I hope you carry an umbrella everywhere you go!"2"Hoenn's One and Only TV Network" TV Mauville"NI heard that Hoenn Rangers is back on the air. I wonder if it's any good."XMauville TV always airs the same old shows, there's not much innovation going on..."gBicycles are more than just a way to get around. For a lot of people, they're a fashion statement!"cI can give your bike a new coat of paint for 400 Glimmer Coins if you want. What do you think?",Alright! Tell me what color you'd like.">Here's your new coat of paint. It's looking pretty slick!"6Changed your mind? No problem, come back anytime!"'Oh, you don't have enough money..."Game Corner"Welcome to TV Mauville."^Many TV programs broadcast in the Hoenn region are filmed and edited in the studios here."#Feel free to tour the studios."PI'm switching out an old Pokémon on my team for this new Kadabra I caught."WIf I feed it Exp. Candies, it'll be up to par with the rest of my team in no time!"^Have you been checking out TVs? Most of the TV broadcasts are made here in Mauville City!"Mazahh!"EHey! Hello, you over there. Do you know about the Hoenn Rangers?"9Ugh.. Of course you don't. I'm not even surprised..."6They're the heroes of our hit TV show, of course."+The Hoenn Rangers Coexistence Force!!!"JHey! Stop laughing! That name scored high in all of our focus groups!"xOkay, okay. The show wasn't exactly a hit, but we had a few good episodes. We even got renewed for a second season!"Problem is..."lEver since our top writer left us to pursue a Pokémon League career, the ratings have been way down..."TCritics said that the end of the season was too over the top, not believable..."0They don't know what they're talking about!"TOh, but production is already underway for Season Two. I don't know what to do!"Wait a second..."IHmm... Could you show me that \C[1]Quests\C[0] app in your PokéNav?"Oh, that's brilliant!"JYes, yes! I could totally use that as inspiration for the new season!"WAfter all, what's better than real-life experience to write a believabele TV Show?"BOkay that's settled, I'm hiring you as an associate producer!"�Fill in your \C[1]Quests app\C[0] and I'll use it as inspiration to write the new season of The Hoenn Rangers Coexistence Force!"wLet's see... The first episode is already half-written, so \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] quests should be enough to complete it."0Come and see me when you've completed them!"uI'm on a tight schedule to finish the first episode of the second season of The Hoenn Rangers Coexistence Force."WDo you have \V[1] completed quests to show me in your Quests app like I asked you?"aAh, you 're a life saver! I knew it was the right move to hire you as an associate producer!"2Let's see...\| Ah, yeah. This is great stuff.":I should give you something as a payment. How's this?"3Alright, let's get started on Episode Two now!"YIt'll be a fairly slow episode, so just a few more quests should probably be enough."XYep, show me your Quests app with \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] completed quests for Episode Two!"OPlease hurry up completing these quests like I asked you! Just \V[2] more!"N\PN! The first episode of Season Two just aired and the critics loved it!"uI can't believe it! After all these low-ratings at the end of the last season! Maybe there's hope for this show."JAh yes, do you have the completed quests I need for the next episode?"AIncredible! You might just be the saving grace of this show!"5Let's see... Oh yeah, this should win them over!"|By the way, the critics were so impressed with the jump in quality for the new episode that they sent us a little gift."I think you deserve it!"4Alright, let's get started on the next episode!"GWe're off to a good start, but we gotta keep the viewers invested."wI'll need \C[1]\V[3]\C[0] more completed quests for that episode! That's \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] total in your Quests app!"Think you can manage that?"?\PN! The second episode just aired and the reviews are in."-Its....\|...\...Overwhelmingly positive!"ZLet's keep the momentum going! Do you have the completed quests for the next episode?"Let's take a look..."IHah! This should be an interesting plot point. Yes, this is perfect!"ZOh yeah, this came in the mail after Episode Two aired. I guess we have fan mail now!"yWe gotta keep the pace! I'll need \C[1]\V[3]\C[0] more quests for the next episode, that's \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] in total!"-I'm sure you can handle that, good luck!"3\PN! The reviews are in for the third episode!"RThis time, it was a bit more mixed... People said there wasn't enough action."oWe're toast if viewership starts going down again. We gotta make sure to make up for it with the next one."hLet's try to make the best episode of the show so far! Do you have all the completed quests I need?"Ah! You never disappoint!"[Oh yes, and those are exciting too! This episode is going to practically write itself!"aBy the way, do you really do all these quests for real? You're not making those up, are you?"SWell, either way, the public is eating it up so keep up whatever you're doing!"TOh, we still got some fan mail for the last episode. It's all yours, of course!"zWe can't waste any time! I'll need \C[1]\V[3]\C[0] more quests for the next episode, that's \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] in total!"I know I can count on you!""\PN! Episode Four just aired!"_People are saying that it was better than all of Season 1! We're totally back in the game!"LI really lucked out when I found you. You're the real star in all this!"EOh, you have the quests for the next episode already? Wonderful!"LBut first, we got some more fan mail! That's all for you, as per usual!"}Alright, let's get to work! I'll need \C[1]\V[3]\C[0] more quests for the next episode, that's \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] in total!"I know you got this!"`We need to finish writing Episode Five as soon as possible. We just need \V[2] more quests!".Thanks for your help, associate producer!"ZWe're taking a mid-season break for now, but I'll need your help again in the future!"rI'm finishing up the episode now. I'm going to need to see \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] completed quests for the next one!"tMy darling Pokémon was abandoned by their previous trainer and rescued by an organization, can you believe it?"Woohoo!"aI hear people call me the \C[1]Rock Smash\C[0] guy, but I find that sort of stuff degrading."JI think I deserve a bit more respect, like maybe the Rock Smash dude."/Anyways, your Pokémon look pretty strong."3But let's see exactly how much. Are you ready?"%I like that! Here, take this HM!"+That HM contains \C[1]Rock Smash\C[0]!">If you come across large boulders that block your path...")Well, use that HM to pulverize them!"0Yes, sir! Smash rocks aside, I say! Woohoo!"2Yes, ma'am! Smash rocks aside, I say! Woohoo!"d\C[2]Notice: You will not be able to use Rock Smash out of battles in this version of the game.",Then you won't get my secret technique!"MOh yes, if you smash a rock, a Pokémon could come flying out of hiding."U\C[2]Notice: You will not be able to use Rock Smash out of battles in this demo."%Welcome to the Pokémon EXP Lab!"�Through a novel procedure, we can safely extract battle experience that you've obtained with your Pokémon into condensed \C[1]Exp. Candies\C[0]!"CIt's a safe way to transfer Exp. from one Pokémon to another!"{The cost is $1000, with an additional fee of $500 per Exp. Candy that gets extracted. Would you like to give it a try?"5Which Pokémon do you want to extract Exp. from?"Come back anytime!"AVery well, I'll take your \V[3]. It'll just be a little bit."kThe extraction was a success! Here's your Pokémon back, with all of the Exp. Candies we've extracted."$Feel free to come back anytime!"OThe Mauville tunnels sure are useful to protect yourself from bad weather!""Hi! Welcome to Mauville City!"IWould you like to know about the different things to do in the city?"&Enjoy your stay in Mauville City!"4So this is where they film the news, huh? Cool!"dIt's a picture of a building in Lavender Town. You can see the famous Pokémon Tower behind it!".Is this your first time in Mauville City?"ZThe city is connected underground through tunnels. They make it easy to get anywhere!"VA poster for the upcoming second season of "The Hoenn Rangers Coexistence Force"!")Hi! We sell furniture and souvenirs!"O... But we're currently waiting on a new shipment. We're all out of stock."oWe give away shirts to Pokémon Trainers. Come and see me if you catch a lot of Pokémon of the same type!">Well, well, what have we here? A most energetic customer!"AMe? You can call me Rydel. I'm the owner of this cycle shop."NYour running shoes, they're awfully filthy... Did you come from far away?"Hm, hm..."DYou came all the way from Littleroot?! That's ridiculously far!"5Hm, hm... Have you been stepping in mud or what?"cIf you had one of my bikes, you could go anywhere while feeling the gentle caress of the wind!".I'll tell you what, I'll give you a bike!">If you go fast enough on a bike, you can climb up slopes!"^Or if you're more of the acrobatic type, you might want to try riding on top of railings!"/This is \PN, reporting on the latest news!"... Better get going!"+It's a poster for "Trainer x Trainer"!"7Do you know about the \C[1]Wallpaper Lottery\C[0]?"�It's a new promotion we're doing for our "Talk of the Town" TV show! We want to encourage Trainers to fill out their Quest Log App!"Every Quest you complete gives you a \C[1]Quest Point\C[0] that you can then spend to obtain a new \C[1]PC Box Background\C[0]!"RIsn't that fun? You can access it from any PC. Feel free to try it over here!")\C[3]Unlocked the Wallpaper Lottery!"WYou're awarded one Quest Point for every quest you complete in your Quest Log App."^You can access the Wallpaper Lottery from any PC to spend them on new PC Box backgrounds!":Now, where do I go to find the Game Corner from here?"7Heyah! Do you know about the move \C[1]\V[4]\C[0]?"tIt allows you to swap abilities with your target! It can be pretty powerful if you're clever with your fusions."CWant me to demonstrate some of my favorite strategies with it?"7Woah! You totally outsmarted my clever strategies!"I'll keep my secrets then!"[A deal's a deal! I'll teach the move \C[1]\V[4]\C[0] to any of your Pokémon for free!"ODone! I hope you come up with a bunch of clever strategies with this move!"As you wish!"(Bicycles have two different speeds!"@Some prefer maneuverability while others prefer pure speed!"RIt's the scheduling for next week's broadcast! When is Hoenn Rangers playing?"3It's the scheduling for next week's broadcast!"(Eek! I saw a Rattata in the tunnel!".A poster for the "Mirage Detection Unit"!"Pokéball Workshop"pWelcome to the Poké Ball Workshop. We can swap the Poké Ball your Pokémon was caught in for another one."HThe cost is $3000 per Pokémon. Would you like to use our services?"#You don't have enough money..."Please come again!"AHmm... Mauville is really big, huh? I hope I don't get lost."JExperience cannot be created out of nothing, nor can it be destroyed."1But it can be transfered using Exp. Candies!"aWelcome to the Pokéball Worksho