\V[2]"That's true!"$Not yet! Please don't spoil it!"9Hey, have you seen the new episode of Hoenn Rangers?"PI have to say, it was one of the best episodes of the entire series so far!"EOh without a doubt! It was so much better than the previous one!"I never saw it coming!"8I want to watch it tonight, don't tell me anything!"�Oh, that was such a strange one. Having the rangers help a struggling film producer write a film based on their exploits felt strangely meta..."EYeah, I'm not too sure where they're going with that plotline..."@Please do not enter the studio when filming is in progress."&Mauville Tourism Information Desk"UI'm the weatherman here at Mauville TV! Have you tuned in to our channel before?"vI work closely with the Weather Institute to get the most accurate readings on the weather for the entire region!"nWe even have an app that you can install on your PokéNav to check the weather on the go. Do you want it?"Here you go!"4I hope you carry an umbrella everywhere you go!"2"Hoenn's One and Only TV Network" TV Mauville"NI heard that Hoenn Rangers is back on the air. I wonder if it's any good."XMauville TV always airs the same old shows, there's not much innovation going on..."gBicycles are more than just a way to get around. For a lot of people, they're a fashion statement!"cI can give your bike a new coat of paint for 400 Glimmer Coins if you want. What do you think?",Alright! Tell me what color you'd like.">Here's your new coat of paint. It's looking pretty slick!"6Changed your mind? No problem, come back anytime!"'Oh, you don't have enough money..."Game Corner"Welcome to TV Mauville."^Many TV programs broadcast in the Hoenn region are filmed and edited in the studios here."#Feel free to tour the studios."PI'm switching out an old Pokémon on my team for this new Kadabra I caught."WIf I feed it Exp. Candies, it'll be up to par with the rest of my team in no time!"^Have you been checking out TVs? Most of the TV broadcasts are made here in Mauville City!"Mazahh!"EHey! Hello, you over there. Do you know about the Hoenn Rangers?"9Ugh.. Of course you don't. I'm not even surprised..."6They're the heroes of our hit TV show, of course."+The Hoenn Rangers Coexistence Force!!!"JHey! Stop laughing! That name scored high in all of our focus groups!"xOkay, okay. The show wasn't exactly a hit, but we had a few good episodes. We even got renewed for a second season!"Problem is..."lEver since our top writer left us to pursue a Pokémon League career, the ratings have been way down..."TCritics said that the end of the season was too over the top, not believable..."0They don't know what they're talking about!"TOh, but production is already underway for Season Two. I don't know what to do!"Wait a second..."IHmm... Could you show me that \C[1]Quests\C[0] app in your PokéNav?"Oh, that's brilliant!"JYes, yes! I could totally use that as inspiration for the new season!"WAfter all, what's better than real-life experience to write a believabele TV Show?"BOkay that's settled, I'm hiring you as an associate producer!"�Fill in your \C[1]Quests app\C[0] and I'll use it as inspiration to write the new season of The Hoenn Rangers Coexistence Force!"wLet's see... The first episode is already half-written, so \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] quests should be enough to complete it."0Come and see me when you've completed them!"uI'm on a tight schedule to finish the first episode of the second season of The Hoenn Rangers Coexistence Force."WDo you have \V[1] completed quests to show me in your Quests app like I asked you?"aAh, you 're a life saver! I knew it was the right move to hire you as an associate producer!"2Let's see...\| Ah, yeah. This is great stuff.":I should give you something as a payment. How's this?"3Alright, let's get started on Episode Two now!"YIt'll be a fairly slow episode, so just a few more quests should probably be enough."XYep, show me your Quests app with \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] completed quests for Episode Two!"OPlease hurry up completing these quests like I asked you! Just \V[2] more!"N\PN! The first episode of Season Two just aired and the critics loved it!"uI can't believe it! After all these low-ratings at the end of the last season! Maybe there's hope for this show."JAh yes, do you have the completed quests I need for the next episode?"AIncredible! You might just be the saving grace of this show!"5Let's see... Oh yeah, this should win them over!"|By the way, the critics were so impressed with the jump in quality for the new episode that they sent us a little gift."I think you deserve it!"4Alright, let's get started on the next episode!"GWe're off to a good start, but we gotta keep the viewers invested."wI'll need \C[1]\V[3]\C[0] more completed quests for that episode! That's \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] total in your Quests app!"Think you can manage that?"?\PN! The second episode just aired and the reviews are in."-Its....\|...\...Overwhelmingly positive!"ZLet's keep the momentum going! Do you have the completed quests for the next episode?"Let's take a look..."IHah! This should be an interesting plot point. Yes, this is perfect!"ZOh yeah, this came in the mail after Episode Two aired. I guess we have fan mail now!"yWe gotta keep the pace! I'll need \C[1]\V[3]\C[0] more quests for the next episode, that's \C[1]\V[1]\C[0] in total!"-I'm sure you can handle that, good luck!"3\PN! The reviews are in for the third episode!"RThis time, it was a bit more mixed... People said there wasn't enough action."oWe're toast if viewership starts going down again. We gotta make sure to make up for it with the next one."hLet's try to make the best episode of the show so far! Do you have all the completed quests I need?"Ah! You never disappoint!"[Oh yes, and those are exciting too! This episode is going to practically write itself!"aBy the way, do you really do all these quests for real? You're not making those up, are you?"SWell, either way, the public is eating it up so keep up whatever you're doing!"TOh, we still got some