el procedure, we can safely extract battle experience that you've obtained with your Pokémon into condensed \C[1]Exp. Candies\C[0]!"CIt's a safe way to transfer Exp. from one Pokémon to another!"{The cost is $1000, with an additional fee of $500 per Exp. Candy that gets extracted. Would you like to give it a try?"5Which Pokémon do you want to extract Exp. from?"Come back anytime!"AVery well, I'll take your \V[3]. It'll just be a little bit."kThe extraction was a success! Here's your Pokémon back, with all of the Exp. Candies we've extracted."$Feel free to come back anytime!"OThe Mauville tunnels sure are useful to protect yourself from bad weather!""Hi! Welcome to Mauville City!"IWould you like to know about the different things to do in the city?"&Enjoy your stay in Mauville City!"4So this is where they film the news, huh? Cool!"dIt's a picture of a building in Lavender Town. You can see the famous Pokémon Tower behind it!".Is this your first time in Mauville City?"ZThe city is connected underground through tunnels. They make it easy to get anywhere!"VA poster for the upcoming second season of "The Hoenn Rangers Coexistence Force"!")Hi! We sell furniture and souvenirs!"O... But we're currently waiting on a new shipment. We're all out of stock."oWe give away shirts to Pokémon Trainers. Come and see me if you catch a lot of Pokémon of the same type!">Well, well, what have we here? A most energetic customer!"AMe? You can call me Rydel. I'm the owner of this cycle shop."NYour running shoes, they're awfully filthy... Did you come from far away?"Hm, hm..."DYou came all the way from Littleroot?! That's ridiculously far!"5Hm, hm... Have you been stepping in mud or what?"cIf you had one of my bikes, you could go anywhere while feeling the gentle caress of the wind!".I'll tell you what, I'll give you a bike!">If you go fast enough on a bike, you can climb up slopes!"^Or if you're more of the acrobatic type, you might want to try riding on top of railings!"/This is \PN, rep