�X[[�"TThe aquarium is bustling with invertebrates and small, colourful fish Pokémon.",A Horsea is hiding behind some seaweed!"&A Shellder is just hanging about!"+That Qwilfish looks curious about you!"NI didn't have $50, so it took a long time to get past the receptionist..."'Come on, stop holding up the line!""Field Moves: Waterfall""M"Some Pokémon are able to swim up waterfalls using the move Waterfall.""d"They charge through the water with powerful bursts of speed that propels up a great distance.""g"Experienced trainers often use this technique to get to places that are otherwise hard to reach.""BIt's a Deep Sea Scale and a Deep Sea Tooth floating in water."fThe Luvdisc in this tank was donated to us after it was accidentally caught in a fisherman's net."QIt's still being rehabilitated, but it's been showing signs of being lonely."\You see, Luvdisc are very social Pokémon that need to be with others of their species!"_We've been looking for a Trainer to rehome the \C[1]Clamperl\C[0] it shares its tank with."RIf you can bring us another \C[1]Luvdisc\C[0], we'll happily trade it to you!"JThank you! This Clamperl was rescued outside of here, in the harbour."�They typically live in much deeper waters so it needed to be rehabilitated for a bit, but now it's ready to continue its journey!"`\C[1]Luvdisc\C[0] can usually be found by fishing in the waters just outside of the museum."DLuvdisc has been doing much better now that it has a companion!"Please enjoy the museum."=It's a painting of the Lake of Rage in the Johto region.""Field Moves: Whirlpool""j"In some areas, strong opposing currents collide, forming whirlpools that are dangerous to traverse.""t"Pokémon can use the move Whirlpool to create inverse whirlpools that cancel them out and allow safe passage.""7The sea is vast without end and infinitely deep...":There must be many Pokémon that we don't know about."0It's a sample of soil from the ocean floor."m"Over many years, the remains of life-forms settle at the bottom of the sea, making sedimentary layers.""?"By analyzing these layers, the ancient past is revealed.""?The S.S. Anne is a famous luxury cruise ship for trainers."BIt sails around the globe yearly, stopping at various cities."DWho even has that kind of money!? Just let me through, come on!":"Corsola are extremely sensitive to water pollution.""U"Areas where they gather in large reefs are an indicator of high water quality.""I want a sea Pokémon!"0I think it would feel cool and nice to hug."gA video is playing of a guy wearing a beanie conducting an experiment with some sort of machine..."�"All life is part of a complex relationship in which each is dependent upon the others, taking from, giving to and living with all the rest.""|"When Clamperl is exposed to either a Deep Sea Scale or a Deep Sea Tooth, it leaves its shell to become free swimming.""�"The Deep Sea Scale allows the pink interior part of its body to take over, while the Deep Sea Tooth makes the blue exterior grow.""6It's a research paper on deep ocean environments.">A fusion of two deep-sea Pokémon is swimming peacefully."!It's a sample of beach sand."^"Stones from mountains are washed down by rivers where they are chipped and ground down.""@"They are reduced to grains and end up as sand on beaches.""CWe were told to assemble here. I don't have a clue why though.",It's a display on the flow of seawater."n"Near the bottom of the sea, water flows due to differences in such factors as temperature and salinity.""E"Only a small percentage of oceans has been explored by humans.""v"It is estimated that there are still thousands of Pokémon species that are yet to be discovered in our oceans.""#Welcome to the Oceanic Museum."Oh, today's your birthday?"3Go right ahead, you can get in for free today!"8\GThe entrance fee is $50. Would you like to enter?"\GPlease enjoy the museum."5Oh, you're with that group that went in earlier?"FYou're the only one who's late. You'd better go catch up to them!"Please visit again!"1It's a sample of sea water with some corals."\"The sea is all connected, but the water's quality and its salinity differs by region.""|"The purity of the water around Pacifidlog Town makes it home to some of the most biodiverse coral reefs in the world.""CIf we stole the stuff in here, it would probably make us rich!"Hey! Quit listening!"J"Toward the surface, seawater flows as currents driven by the winds.""Oh! Is that a Krabby?"Look at that Magikarp!"6There's a school of Luvdisc swimming in the back!"FThat replica of the S.S. Anne alone must be worth a ton of money!"?"Water currents have a significant effect on the climate.""�"Fast moving water cools down faster which leads to colder temperatures, while a slower flow allows the water to absorb more heat.""2I get all giddy and gooey when I see the sea!"8For me, Captain Stern is the number-one role model!".A rubber ball is expanding and shrinking.">"In the sea, the weight of water itself exerts pressure.""8"In shallow water, the pressure is not very heavy.""P"However, in deep water, the pressure can reach tens of thousands of tons."">What I learn here, I can put to use on nefarious deeds..."NPeople may not like our methods, but we're working hard to save humanity."SLooking at model ships reminds me of Mr. Briney who lives near Petalburg Town."SThe ends justify the means. People will thank Team Aqua once this is all over."GI want to learn about the sea and use that knowledge for battling."%It's a replica of the S.S. Anne!"Young man..."Young woman..."Ah, \PN, is it?"DThat was quite a tense situation! Thank you for helping me out!"LWhat they were saying about this asteroid... I don't know if it's true."9It's certainly the first time I've ever heard of it."DOh, yes, I almost forgot that you brought the parts from Devon!"1\PN handed the Devon Parts to Captain Stern."dThese parts are an essential component that allows machines to operate in extreme environments.">I don't know why Team Aqua and Team Magma are after it..."yAll I know is that Devon Corp. developed it for a secret project and that they want me to test it in the deep ocean."GAnd it's an urgent matter too, so I should get to work right away!"$Thanks for this, and excuse me!"!Don't run inside the museum!""Field Moves: Dive""X"Some advanced trainers are able to use the move Dive to explore underwater areas.""r"While using the move, the Pokémon regulate their trainer's internal pressure and provide them with oxygen.""W"This Pokémon technique was used as a blueprint for the invention of submarines.""XWe came here for other reasons, but these exhibits are actually pretty interesting."IStern! Give me those Devon Parts pronto! It's for the sake of Hoenn!"(But.. These parts aren't for you..."OAnd even if they were, I don't have them. Devon hasn't delivered them yet!"... And who might you be?"DYou came to deliver the \C[1]Devon Parts\C[0] to Captain Stern?"What excellent timing!"Grunts! Grab them!"Aye, aye!"AThe boss wants the parts, so shut your yap and fork it over!"Boss, I'm soooo sorry!"	Heh!"BThat's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp.""The name is \C[1]Archie\C[0]."TThe rough-looking lot you see here are members of my team, \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0]."CForgive my methods, but we need these parts you have urgently."{I can see you're not just another mindless brat, so I'll explain why exactly. Then you'll be free to make up your own mind."PYou see now, \PN? When that asteroid hits... This whole region is finished!"kDevon Corp and the Space Center want to hide it from the public... But we know how to get information!"MHah! Don't start panicking just yet. Team Aqua has thought this through!"HThere's a way to save both Pokémon and humankind at the same time!"MThere's no need to run from the disaster. All we need is to adapt to it!"GYou see \PN, humanity's greatest strength is its ability to adapt."oIt may seem drastic, but the only way for Hoenn to survive this is to embrace the changes that are coming."@<fs=36>Don't listen to one more word of this nonsense!</fs>"SThis plan is laughable at best. You Team Aqua are nothing but misguided fools."3Team Magma... Ughh... What are you doing here?"fMy team and I were on our way to Mt. Chimney when we noticed some unusual activity at the museum."VSo we stopped to investigate. And what an interesting development we stumbled on!"I am called \C[2]Maxie."fI stand at the head of \C[2]Team Magma\C[0], a noble organization which values logic and science."dIt is true that this asteroid cannot be stopped, but we do not need to abandon our way of life."TAll we need to do is prepare... So that it never reaches us in the first place."x\PN, this asteroid will change life as we know it. We must do everything to be fully prepared before it's too late."NAnd this is why we need those Devon parts right now!\. Grunts, grab them!"@Humph... I suppose this is a lot for a child to comprehend."`Tell me, \PN. What do you think is the best way to face an existential threat such as this?"This asteroid is powerful. We need to \C[2]defend \C[0]ourselves against it by putting some distance between us and the oceans."ZNo! We cannot stop nature, we need to \C[1]adapt \C[0]and learn to live alongside it."
So..."}Now you understand what I am trying to achieve with \C[2]Team Magma\C[0]. I am glad to see that I have opened your mind."WWe have set up camp just North of here. Join us there if you believe in our cause."5Humph... I'll withdraw for now and leave you be."`But know this, if you get in the way of \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0], you won't walk away unscathed."oSmart kid! Nature is too powerful to defend against it, we need to learn how to live alongside it instead."2This is what \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0] strives for."\We have a camp on \C[1]Slateport Beach\C[0]. Join us there if you believe in our cause."+Humph... I will take my leave for now."UI suggest you take care that you never again stand against \C[2]Team Magma\C[0]."%I will not be lenient if you do."&Wow! The sea Pokémon is awesome!""Field Moves: Surf""X"Trainers often use their Pokémon to ferry them across water using the move Surf.""T"The Pokémon creates waves on which it surfs to carry a trainer effortlessly.""^"Apparently, this method of traveling on the water predates even the invention of boats.""(This is ridiculous! Where's Archie?"Yes"No"I'm not sure..."Defend against it"Adapt to it[�"[L'aquarium grouille d'invertébrés et autres petits Pokémon poissons très colorés."1Un Hypotrempe se cache derrière des algues!":Ce Kokiyas est juste en train de faire sa petite vie!"AOn dirait que vous avez piqué la curiosité de ce Qwilfish!"aJe n'avais pas 50$, donc il m'a fallu un moment pour réussir à contourner la réception..."!Allez, vous bloquez la file!"%"Capacités de Terrain: Cascade""d"Certains Pokémon ont le pouvoir de remonter les chutes d'eau grâce à la capacité Cascade.""~"Ils foncent à travers l'eau en faisant des pointes de vitesse leur permettant de se projeter sur de grandes distances.""}"Les dresseurs expérimentés utilisent cette technique pour accéder à des endroits très difficiles d'atteinte autrement.""MIl y a une Écaille Océan et et une Dent Océan qui flottent sur l'eau."xLe Lovdisc de ce bassin nous a été donné après avoir été accidentellement happé dans le filet d'un pêcheur."`Il est encore en train d'être réhabilité, hélas il montre de graves signes de solitude."|Tu sais, les Lovdisc sont des Pokémon très sociables qui ont besoin d'être en compagnie d'autres membres de leur espèce!"bNous cherchons un dresseur pour adopter ce \C[1]Coquiperl\C[0] avec qui il partage ce bassin."|Si tu peux nous apporter un autre \C[1]Lovdisc\C[0], nous nous ferons un plaisir de te l'échanger contre ce Coquiperl!"HMerci! Ce Coquiperl a été secouru dans le port, tout près d'ici."�En temps normal, ils vivent dans des eaux bien plus profondes alors il avait besoin d'être réhabilité quelques temps, mais maintenant il est fin prêt à repartir!"fLes \C[1]Lovdisc\C[0] peuvent être trouvés en pêchant dans les eaux juste en dehors du musée."NLovdisc a l'air beaucoup plus heureux maintenant qu'il a de la compagnie!"$Passez un bon moment au musée."@C'est une peinture du Lac Colère dans la région de Johto."$"Capacités de Terrain: Siphon""l"A certains endroits, des courants marins opposés se rencontrent et forment de dangereux tourbillons.""�"Les Pokémon peuvent utiliser la capacité Siphon pour créer un tourbillon dans le sens inverse et ainsi le faire disparaitre, assurant un passage sans accroc.""IL'océan s'étend jusqu'à l'horizon et semble infiniment profond..."LIl doit y avoir de nombreux Pokémon dont on ignore encore l'existence."3C'est un échantillon de sol des fonds marins."�"Au cours de nombreuses années, les restes des différentes formes de vie se déposent au fond de l'océan, formant ainsi des couches sédimentaires.""V"En analysant ces différentes couches, nous pouvons mieux comprendre le passé.""ZLe célèbre navire L'Océane est un luxueux bateau de croisière pour les dresseurs."]Il voyage à travers le monde chaque année et fait escale dans toutes sortes de villes."EPersonne n'a ce genre d'argent! Allez, laissez-moi juste passer!"H"Les Corayon sont extrêmement sensibles à la pollution de l'eau.""o"Lorsqu'ils se réunissent dans de grands récifs, cela signifie que l'eau y est de très bonne qualité.""Je veux un Pokémon marin!"6Ils doivent être frais et agréable à câliner."oUne vidéo tourne, on y voit un homme portant un bonnet faire une expérience avec une étrange machine..."�"Toutes les formes de vies appartiennent à un écosystème complexe où chacun est dépendant des autres, prenant, donnant et vivant avec le reste.""|"Lorsque Coquiperl est exposé à une Écaille Océan ou une Dent Océan, il délaisse sa coquille et peut nager librement.""�"L'Écaille Océan permet à la partie rose de son corps de prendre le dessus, tandis que la Dent Océan fait grandir la partie bleue à l'extérieur.""CC'est un article scientifique sur les profondeurs océaniques."IUne fusion de deux Pokémon venus des profondeurs nage paisiblement."-C'est un échantillon de sable de plage."p"Les roches des montagnes sont détrempées par les rivières, ce qui les rend friables et les décompose.""L"Elles sont réduites en poussière et deviennent le sable des plages.""POn nous a dit de nous rassembler ici. Mais on n'a aucune idée de pourquoi."9C'est une représentation des courants d'eau marins."�"Au fond de la mer, les variations de certains facteurs tels que la température et la salinité provoquent le mouvement de l'eau.""G"Les humains n'ont exploré qu'un maigre pourcentage des océans.""i"On estime qu'il y reste encore des milliers d'espèces de Pokémon à découvrir dans nos océans.""*Bienvenue au Musée Océanographique.".Oh, c'est votre anniversaire aujourd'hui?"4Alors allez-y, vous pouvez entrer gratuitement!"0\GLe ticket est à 50$. Voulez-vous entrer?"#\GPassez une agréable visite."7Oh, tu es dans le groupe qui est entré plus tôt?"OJe crois que tu es le seul à la bourre. Tu ferais mieux de les rattraper!"N'hésitez pas à revenir!">C'est un échantillon d'eau de mer accompagné de coraux."s"La mer est entièrement connectée, mais la qualité de l'eau et sa salinité diffèrent selon les régions.""�"La pureté de l'eau autour de Pacifiville en fait le théâtre de récifs coraux abritant une biodiversité parmi les plus formidables du monde.""KSi on piquait les trucs qui sont ici, on deviendrait sûrement riches!"Hé! Écoute pas, toi!"P"En surface, l'eau de mer circule comme des courants poussés par le vent.""Oh! C'est un Krabby?"Regarde ce Magicarpe!">Il y a un banc de Lovdisc en train de nager dans le fond!"ACette réplique de l'Océane doit valoir une petite fortune!"="Les courants ont un impact significatif sur le climat.""�"L'eau qui s'écoule rapidement se rafraichit vite et permet de faire chuter les températures, tandis que des courants plus lents permettent à l'eau d'absorber plus de chaleur.""2Ça me fait tout drôle quand je vois la mer!"(Le Capitaine Poupe est mon modèle!"5Une balle en caoutchouc s'allonge et rétrécit."D"Dans la mer, le poids de l'eau exerce lui-même une pression.""A"En eau peu profonde, la pression n'est pas très élevée.""x"Par contre, en profondeur, la pression peut atteindre des dizaines de milliers de tonnes sur une petite étendue.""KCe que j'apprends ici, je peux m'en servir pour de sombres desseins..."lLes gens n'apprécient peut-être pas nos méthodes, mais nous travaillons dur pour sauver l'humanité."jRegarder des maquettes de bateau, ça me fait penser à M. Marco qui habite près de Clémenti-Ville."`La fin justifie les moyens. Tout le monde remerciera la Team Aqua quand tout sera terminé."OJe veux en savoir plus sur la mer et utiliser ces connaissances en combat."&C'est une réplique de l'Océane!"Jeune homme..."Jeune fille..."Ah, \PN, c'est bien ça?"3C'est pas passé loin! Merci de m'avoir aidé."IIls parlaient de cet astéroïde... je ne sais pas si c'était vrai."FEn tout cas, c'est la première fois que j'entends parler de ça."BOh, oui, j'ai failli oublier que tu m'apportes le Pack Devon!"0\PN donne le Pack Devon au Capitaine Poupe."sCe pack contient des pièces essentielles qui permettent aux machines d'opérer dans des conditions extrêmes."MJe ne sais pas pourquoi la Team Aqua et la Team Magma le veulent tant..."�Tout ce que je sais, c'est que la Devon SARL l'a développé pour un projet secret, et qu'ils veulent que je le teste dans les profondeurs de la mer."REt c'est aussi très urgent, donc je ferai mieux de m'y mettre tout de suite!"&Merci pour tout, je dois y aller!"+Interdiction de courir dans le musée!"&"Capacités de Terrain: Plongée""k"Les dresseurs expérimentés sont capables d'utiliser Plongée pour explorer les zones sous-marines.""�"En utilisant cette capacité, le Pokémon est capable de réguler la pression interne du dresseur ainsi que de lui fournir de l'oxygène.""_"Cette technique Pokémon fut utilisée comme modèle pour la conception des sous-marins.""[Nous sommes ici pour d'autres raisons, mais ces expositions sont super intéressantes."NPoupe! Donne-moi tout de suite ce Pack Devon! C'est pour le bien d'Hoenn!"1Mais... Ces pièces ne sont pas pour vous..."QEt même si c'était le cas, je ne l'ai pas. Devon ne l'a pas encore livré!"... Et toi, qui es-tu?"@Tu viens livrer le \C[1]Pack Devon\C[0] au Capitaine Poupe?" Mais quel excellent timing!"Sbires! Emparez-vous en!"Aye, aye!"DL'boss veut le Pack, alors tu vas nous le donner bien sagement!"Boss, pardoooon!"	Heh!"NVoilà une expression bien féroce pour une aussi jeune personne que toi."#Je m'appelle \C[1]Arthur\C[0]."WLes gaillards que tu vois ici sont les membres de ma Team, la \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0]."mPardonnes nos méthodes, mais nous avons vraiment besoin des pièces que contient le Pack, c'est urgent."�Je vois que tu n'es pas n'importe quel mioche, donc je vais te dire pourquoi. Ensuite, libre à toi de forger ton opinion sur la question."dTu comprends maintenant, \PN? Quand cet astéroïde chutera... Toute la région sera anéantie!"cLa Devon SARL et le Centre Spatial veulent le cacher au public... Mais nous avons nos sources!"AHah! Mais aucune raison de paniquer. La Team Aqua a un plan!"IIl existe un moyen de sauver à la fois les humains et les Pokémon."SNous n'avons pas besoin de fuir ce désastre. Nous devons nous adapter à lui!"[Tu sais, \PN, la plus grande force de l'humanité, c'est notre capacité d'adaptation."�Cela peut sembler drastique, mais c'est en acceptant ces changements imminents que la région d'Hoenn survivra à la catastrophe."N<fs=36>N'écoute pas un mot de plus, ce ne sont que des absurdités!</fs>"cC'est un plan parfaitement ridicule. La Team Aqua n'est composée que d'imbéciles malavisés."<La Team Magma... urgh... Qu'est-ce que vous faites ici?"{Ma team et moi étions en route pour le Mont Chimnée quand nous avons remarqué une activité inhabituelle au musée."wDonc, nous nous sommes arrêtés pour mener l'enquête. Et nous avons bien fait, quel développement intéressant!"Je me prénomme \C[2]Max."qJe suis à la tête de la \C[2]Team Magma\C[0], une noble organisation guidée par la logique et la science."rIl est vrai que cet astéroïde ne peut être stoppé, mais nous n'avons pas à abandonner notre mode de vie."wTout ce que nous devons faire, c'est nous préparer... De manière à ce qu'il ne puisse même pas nous atteindre."�\PN, cet astéroïde va changer la vie telle que nous la connaissons. Nous devons tout faire pour être prêts avant qu'il ne soit trop tard."ZEt c'est pourquoi nous avons besoin du Pack Devon tout de suite!\. Sbires, prenez-le!"aHmmm... je suppose que c'est un peu trop difficile à comprendre pour quelqu'un de ton âge."pDis-moi, \PN. A ton avis, quel est le meilleur moyen de faire face à une menace existentielle aussi grave?"Cet astéroïde est redoutable. Nous devons nous \C[2]défendre \C[0] en mettant de la distance entre nous et les océans."�Non! On ne peut pas arrêter les forces de la nature, nous devons nous \C[2]adapter \C[0] et apprendre à vivre en harmonie avec elle."Alors..."qMaintenant tu comprends l'objectif de la \C[2]Team Magma\C[0]. Je suis heureux d'avoir pu t'ouvrir l'esprit."fNous avons installé un campement au Nord d'ici. Rejoins-nous là-bas si tu crois en notre cause."4Pff... Je m'en vais et je te laisse tranquille."oMais sache une chose, si tu te mets en travers de la \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0], tu n'en ressortiras pas indemne."zSage décision! La nature est bien trop puissante pour être défiée, nous devons apprendre à vivre à ses côtés."7C'est tout ce que souhaite la \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0]."sNous avons un campement sur la \C[1]Plage de Poivressel\C[0]. Rejoins-nous là-bas si tu crois en notre cause."5Pfft... Dans ce cas je me retire pour l'instant."`Fais bien attention, je te suggère de ne plus jamais t'opposer à la \C[2]Team Magma\C[0].";Je ne ferais preuve d'aucune indulgence si tu essayes."3Wouah! Le Pokémon des océans est formidable!"""Capacités de Terrain: Surf""q"Les dresseurs utilisent souvent leurs Pokémon pour traverser les plans d'eau grâce à la capacité Surf.""j"Le Pokémon génère des vagues sur lesquelles surfer afin de transporter son dresseur sans effort.""e"Apparemment, cette méthode de navigation est antérieure à l'invention des premiers bateaux.""$C'est ridicule! Où est Arthur?"Oui"Non"Je ne suis pas sûr..."Se défendre"S'adapter;[�"TThe aquarium is bustling with invertebrates and small, colourful fish Pokémon.",A Horsea is hiding behind some seaweed!"&A Shellder is just hanging about!"+That Qwilfish looks curious about you!"NI didn't have $50, so it took a long time to get past the receptionist..."'Come on, stop holding up the line!""Field Moves: Waterfall""M"Some Pokémon are able to swim up waterfalls using the move Waterfall.""d"They charge through the water with powerful bursts of speed that propels up a great distance.""g"Experienced trainers often use this technique to get to places that are otherwise hard to reach.""BIt's a Deep Sea Scale and a Deep Sea Tooth floating in water."fThe Luvdisc in this tank was donated to us after it was accidentally caught in a fisherman's net."QIt's still being rehabilitated, but it's been showing signs of being lonely."\You see, Luvdisc are very social Pokémon that need to be with others of their species!"_We've been looking for a Trainer to rehome the \C[1]Clamperl\C[0] it shares its tank with."RIf you can bring us another \C[1]Luvdisc\C[0], we'll happily trade it to you!"JThank you! This Clamperl was rescued outside of here, in the harbour."�They typically live in much deeper waters so it needed to be rehabilitated for a bit, but now it's ready to continue its journey!"`\C[1]Luvdisc\C[0] can usually be found by fishing in the waters just outside of the museum."DLuvdisc has been doing much better now that it has a companion!"Please enjoy the museum."=It's a painting of the Lake of Rage in the Johto region.""Field Moves: Whirlpool""j"In some areas, strong opposing currents collide, forming whirlpools that are dangerous to traverse.""t"Pokémon can use the move Whirlpool to create inverse whirlpools that cancel them out and allow safe passage.""7The sea is vast without end and infinitely deep...":There must be many Pokémon that we don't know about."0It's a sample of soil from the ocean floor."m"Over many years, the remains of life-forms settle at the bottom of the sea, making sedimentary layers.""?"By analyzing these layers, the ancient past is revealed.""?The S.S. Anne is a famous luxury cruise ship for trainers."BIt sails around the globe yearly, stopping at various cities."DWho even has that kind of money!? Just let me through, come on!":"Corsola are extremely sensitive to water pollution.""U"Areas where they gather in large reefs are an indicator of high water quality.""I want a sea Pokémon!"0I think it would feel cool and nice to hug."gA video is playing of a guy wearing a beanie conducting an experiment with some sort of machine..."�"All life is part of a complex relationship in which each is dependent upon the others, taking from, giving to and living with all the rest.""|"When Clamperl is exposed to either a Deep Sea Scale or a Deep Sea Tooth, it leaves its shell to become free swimming.""�"The Deep Sea Scale allows the pink interior part of its body to take over, while the Deep Sea Tooth makes the blue exterior grow.""6It's a research paper on deep ocean environments.">A fusion of two deep-sea Pokémon is swimming peacefully."!It's a sample of beach sand."^"Stones from mountains are washed down by rivers where they are chipped and ground down.""@"They are reduced to grains and end up as sand on beaches.""CWe were told to assemble here. I don't have a clue why though.",It's a display on the flow of seawater."n"Near the bottom of the sea, water flows due to differences in such factors as temperature and salinity.""E"Only a small percentage of oceans has been explored by humans.""v"It is estimated that there are still thousands of Pokémon species that are yet to be discovered in our oceans.""#Welcome to the Oceanic Museum."Oh, today's your birthday?"3Go right ahead, you can get in for free today!"8\GThe entrance fee is $50. Would you like to enter?"\GPlease enjoy the museum."5Oh, you're with that group that went in earlier?"FYou're the only one who's late. You'd better go catch up to them!"Please visit again!"1It's a sample of sea water with some corals."\"The sea is all connected, but the water's quality and its salinity differs by region.""|"The purity of the water around Pacifidlog Town makes it home to some of the most biodiverse coral reefs in the world.""CIf we stole the stuff in here, it would probably make us rich!"Hey! Quit listening!"J"Toward the surface, seawater flows as currents driven by the winds.""Oh! Is that a Krabby?"Look at that Magikarp!"6There's a school of Luvdisc swimming in the back!"FThat replica of the S.S. Anne alone must be worth a ton of money!"?"Water currents have a significant effect on the climate.""�"Fast moving water cools down faster which leads to colder temperatures, while a slower flow allows the water to absorb more heat.""2I get all giddy and gooey when I see the sea!"8For me, Captain Stern is the number-one role model!".A rubber ball is expanding and shrinking.">"In the sea, the weight of water itself exerts pressure.""8"In shallow water, the pressure is not very heavy.""P"However, in deep water, the pressure can reach tens of thousands of tons."">What I learn here, I can put to use on nefarious deeds..."NPeople may not like our methods, but we're working hard to save humanity."SLooking at model ships reminds me of Mr. Briney who lives near Petalburg Town."SThe ends justify the means. People will thank Team Aqua once this is all over."GI want to learn about the sea and use that knowledge for battling."%It's a replica of the S.S. Anne!"Young man..."Young woman..."Ah, \PN, is it?"DThat was quite a tense situation! Thank you for helping me out!"LWhat they were saying about this asteroid... I don't know if it's true."9It's certainly the first time I've ever heard of it."DOh, yes, I almost forgot that you brought the parts from Devon!"1\PN handed the Devon Parts to Captain Stern."dThese parts are an essential component that allows machines to operate in extreme environments.">I don't know why Team Aqua and Team Magma are after it..."yAll I know is that Devon Corp. developed it for a secret project and that they want me to test it in the deep ocean."GAnd it's an urgent matter too, so I should get to work right away!"$Thanks for this, and excuse me!"!Don't run inside the museum!""Field Moves: Dive""X"Some advanced trainers are able to use the move Dive to explore underwater areas.""r"While using the move, the Pokémon regulate their trainer's internal pressure and provide them with oxygen.""W"This Pokémon technique was used as a blueprint for the invention of submarines.""XWe came here for other reasons, but these exhibits are actually pretty interesting."IStern! Give me those Devon Parts pronto! It's for the sake of Hoenn!"(But.. These parts aren't for you..."OAnd even if they were, I don't have them. Devon hasn't delivered them yet!"... And who might you be?"DYou came to deliver the \C[1]Devon Parts\C[0] to Captain Stern?"What excellent timing!"Grunts! Grab them!"Aye, aye!"AThe boss wants the parts, so shut your yap and fork it over!"Boss, I'm soooo sorry!"	Heh!"BThat's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp.""The name is \C[1]Archie\C[0]."TThe rough-looking lot you see here are members of my team, \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0]."CForgive my methods, but we need these parts you have urgently."{I can see you're not just another mindless brat, so I'll explain why exactly. Then you'll be free to make up your own mind."PYou see now, \PN? When that asteroid hits... This whole region is finished!"kDevon Corp and the Space Center want to hide it from the public... But we know how to get information!"MHah! Don't start panicking just yet. Team Aqua has thought this through!"HThere's a way to save both Pokémon and humankind at the same time!"MThere's no need to run from the disaster. All we need is to adapt to it!"GYou see \PN, humanity's greatest strength is its ability to adapt."oIt may seem drastic, but the only way for Hoenn to survive this is to embrace the changes that are coming."@<fs=36>Don't listen to one more word of this nonsense!</fs>"SThis plan is laughable at best. You Team Aqua are nothing but misguided fools."3Team Magma... Ughh... What are you doing here?"fMy team and I were on our way to Mt. Chimney when we noticed some unusual activity at the museum."VSo we stopped to investigate. And what an interesting development we stumbled on!"I am called \C[2]Maxie."fI stand at the head of \C[2]Team Magma\C[0], a noble organization which values logic and science."dIt is true that this asteroid cannot be stopped, but we do not need to abandon our way of life."TAll we need to do is prepare... So that it never reaches us in the first place."x\PN, this asteroid will change life as we know it. We must do everything to be fully prepared before it's too late."NAnd this is why we need those Devon parts right now!\. Grunts, grab them!"@Humph... I suppose this is a lot for a child to comprehend."`Tell me, \PN. What do you think is the best way to face an existential threat such as this?"This asteroid is powerful. We need to \C[2]defend \C[0]ourselves against it by putting some distance between us and the oceans."ZNo! We cannot stop nature, we need to \C[1]adapt \C[0]and learn to live alongside it."
So..."}Now you understand what I am trying to achieve with \C[2]Team Magma\C[0]. I am glad to see that I have opened your mind."WWe have set up camp just North of here. Join us there if you believe in our cause."5Humph... I'll withdraw for now and leave you be."`But know this, if you get in the way of \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0], you won't walk away unscathed."oSmart kid! Nature is too powerful to defend against it, we need to learn how to live alongside it instead."2This is what \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0] strives for."\We have a camp on \C[1]Slateport Beach\C[0]. Join us there if you believe in our cause."+Humph... I will take my leave for now."UI suggest you take care that you never again stand against \C[2]Team Magma\C[0]."%I will not be lenient if you do."&Wow! The sea Pokémon is awesome!""Field Moves: Surf""X"Trainers often use their Pokémon to ferry them across water using the move Surf.""T"The Pokémon creates waves on which it surfs to carry a trainer effortlessly.""^"Apparently, this method of traveling on the water predates even the invention of boats.""(This is ridiculous! Where's Archie?"Yes"No"I'm not sure..."Defend against it"Adapt to itIu;␀&[[#"VMaking a big ship is more like constructing a building than assembling a vehicle."An email is on the screen."{"Ferry construction to be paused until further notice. All efforts should be redirected towards Submarine Explorer 1.""^Captain Stern made us halt the construction of the ferry to work on a deep-sea submarine."*I wonder what's so urgent about it..."PIt's showing blueprints and schematics for some kind of deep-sea submarine.":Umm... If this goes here, and that goes over there..."BThen where does this thing go? And what about that doohickey?"1Aaargh! I can't make heads or tails of this!"Hm? You..."Oh, sorry. I'm Dock."Y\C[1]Captain Stern\C[0] commissioned me to draw up designs for a deep-sea submarine."OOne that can dive deeper than any other submarine... It's a real headache."}Oh! Are those the Devon part