ieux!"'Il y a d'autres tags à recouvrir."'Vous avez recouvert tous les tags!"aQuelqu'un a peint le logo de la Team Magmaa sur le mur... Souhaitez-vous peindre par-dessus?"$C'est le logo de la Team Magma!"#C'est le logo de la Team Aqua!"Oui"Non;["|They've been talking about finishing the ferry for years now, but they always find new reasons to put the project on hold...";I wonder if I could take a ferry all the way to Kanto."ESomeone painted the Team Aqua logo on the wall... Paint over it?"Much better!".There is still more graffiti to cover up."#You covered up every graffiti!"FSomeone painted the Team Magma logo on the wall... Paint over it?"It's the Team Magma logo!"It's the Team Aqua logo!"Yes"NoIu;␀&[[P".Okay, so you finished your training, huh?"BWelcome to the crew! You're officially part of Team Aqua now."Alright then, listen up!"lOne of the crew spotted some \C[1]Wailmer Eggs \C[0] on the way here. I need a hand to go pick them up.",So you're coming with me. Get on board!"!Ahh! There's one right here!"jThat's a \C[1]Wailmer Egg\C[0] alright. Think of how strong we'll be with a bunch of Wailmer fusions!"DThere's gotta be more around. Go see if you can find some more!"JHey, you're with us now, put on your uniform! I won't tell you twice!"It's scorching hot!"mUghh... Can you believe it? \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0] graffitied their logo all over \C[1]Slateport City\C[0]."�They even painted the walls inside of the harbour... The absolute disrespect! It'll be the first thing that people see when it's back in service..."xSlateport City is \C[2]Team Magma\C[0]'s turf! They think they can claim our territory with a splash of blue paint?"Absolutely not!!"HI'd go cover up their awful logo with the Magnificent Team Magma M!"0Gah... But I'm stuck here on sweeping duty."&Oh, I know! You go instead of me!"YTake this. I don't want to see a single Team Aqua logo in the town when you're done!"EAre you with us? I can't recognize anyone without their uniform."�They even painted the walls inside of the Slateport harbour... The absolute disrespect! It'll be the first thing that people see when it's back in service..."qYou painted over every graffiti! Now the people will know who's really in charge in Slateport City. Muhahah!"WA job well done deserves a reward! I found all this money while sweeping the tent."^Normally I'd keep it all for myself, but since you helped me out, I'll split it with you."+\C[3]Grunt Work!: \C[2]\V[1029]/3\C[0]"mI counted 5 graffiti in total. Let's paint over them and show Team Aqua who this town really belongs to!"?I wonder if Maxie designed our magnificent M logo himself.")Let's practice the Magma Theme song!"Hyuh? And you are?"Uwaaah! Team Aqua!!!">Wait... Oh, you're just that kid from the oceanic museum."Sorry for being a bit jumpy... Team Aqua has been active around here, so Maxie put me in charge of keeping an eye on them."�Can you believe it? Me, the great \C[2]Tabitha\C[0], one of the highest-ranking Team Magma members... Staying behind on surveillance duty..."#Ehh, no matter... I'm over it.":So, you came here because you want to join our ranks?"That's the spirit!"AUh... I haven't ever really trained any new grunts before..."tI guess you should go around the camp see if some of the grunts need help with anything and report to me after."WI think there's a spare uniform in this box. Put it on before you leave this tent!";Uwaaah!? You're with \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0], aren't you!?"Out! And don't come back!"+That uniform looks half decent on you!"bSome of the grunts in the camp should have tasks for you. Go help them and report back to me.""Good, now put on the uniform!"nThere should be an extra uniform in this box. Put it on and go see if some of the other grunts need help.")Huh? You're done with your training?"HWell... I guess you're officially part of Team Magma now, congrats!""That's great timing actually."�I sent one of the grunts to scout the area when we set up camp here and he said he spotted