tre chance!\wtnp[15]"TCela fait {1} bonnes réponses d'affilée. Vous avez le vent en poupe!\wtnp[20]"XCela fait {1} bonnes réponses d'affilée. Vous vous en sortez très bien!\wtnp[20]"RVoici {1} points supplémentaires pour le maintient de votre série!\wtnp[15]"C'est votre dernier mot?"Type with your keyboard"1Wow! Un pokémone a sauté hors de la fleur!")C'est une fleur avec un nectar rose."){1} a cueilli quelques fleurs roses.",C'est une fleur avec un nectar rouge. ."*{1} a cueilli quelques fleurs rouges.")C'est une fleur avec un nectar bleu."*{1} a cueilli quelques fleurs bleues."*C'est une fleur avec un nectar jaune."Le montrer à un Pokémon?"%{1} flipped the seashell over..."...Il n'y a rien."EWhat do you think? Do you think any of these have any potential?"Pas vraiment..."5It's a vending machine. What do you want to buy?"Purchase anything else?"�Sootopolis Void attacked the city and tried to steal a precious package from the Rangers headquarters. Littleroot Crimson was able to stop him, but now he's coming back with a vengeance..."zThere was a part where Littleroot Crimson had a rematch with Fallarbor Bordeaux and he finally evolved his Combusken."�There was an entire subplot about Rustboro Ivory entering a berry-growing contest that she ended up winning with a super-mutant berry."There was a part where Lilicove Viridian waited until the wind picked up to catch a Pidgeot that had been terrorizing the town."jAt one point, Mauville Yellow met a scientist in the woods and helped him collect highly toxic spore."kLittleroot Crimson seeked out the help of the grandmaster that was hiding at the end of the dark cave."IRustboro Ivory befriended that lonely Oricorio in the flowers field."'The Oricorio kept switching forms!"�Mauville Yellow fused a Pellipper with Exploud to create a sonic weapon. And then it ended up being much too loud, it was so funny!"IPacifidlog Cobalt found that shiny Azumarill. I never saw it coming!"{At least, Littleroot Crimson finally delivered that precious package. I can't wait to see what happens next with that."UHey, that part where Fallarbor Bordeaux fished up that Dragalge was pretty neat."bThat whole subplot about Pacifidlog Cobalt trying to get a tan definitely dragged on a bit..."nAlthough that scene with Lilicove Viridian beating up all the bad guys in the beach house was really fun!"sThe chase sequence with the Kingler when Mauville Yellow was carrying that beach ball was really funny though!"UI never expected Littleroot Crimson to infiltrate the villains's lair like that!"+You need to allow at least one sprite!"Ce sprite restera affiché""Ce sprite est déjà affiché"1C'est le seul sprite dispo pour ce Pokémon!"9Evoli commence à fatiguer. Tu devrais rentrer vite!"Main Quests"Quêtes d'hôtel"Quêtes de terrain"Quêtes de la Team Rocket"Quêtes légendaires" \C[3]NEW MAIN OBJECTIVE: \
