unes"�Une entité étrange t'a demandé de lui rapporter des Plumes Lunes. Elle viendra la nuit pour te dire où chercher... qui que ce soit."Visit Dad!"4Go visit your Dad at his Gym in Petalburg Town!"Petalburg City"Catching Tutoring"%Catch a wild Pokémon for Wally."The Pokémon Gym Challenge"GChallenge Roxanne in Rustboro City to obtain your first Gym Badge."Mérouville"FChallenge Brawly in Dewford Town to obtain your second Gym Badge."Myokara"GChallenge Wattson in Mauville City to obtain your third Gym Badge."Lavandia"JChallenge Flannery in Lavaridge Town to obtain your fourth Gym Badge."Vermilava"GChallenge Norman in Petalburg City to obtain your fifth Gym Badge."Clémenti-Ville"EChallenge Winona in Fortree City to obtain your sixth Gym Badge."Cimetronelle"MChallenge Tate & Liza in Mossdeep City to obtain your seventh Gym Badge."Algatia"IChallenge Wallace in Sootopolis City to obtain your final Gym Badge."Atalanopolis""The Pokémon League Challenge"CCollect all 8 Gym Badges and take part in the Pokémon League!"
