gma. Go meet them at their camp, North of Slateport."Soaking in the sun"8Sit in a beach chair until your suntan is on point!"Route 109"&Hot Battles at the Seashore House"6Defeat all of the trainers in the Seashore House!"Find a New Beach Ball!"CReplace the popped beach ball of the kids playing on the beach"Under Attack!"2Defend the Team Magma Camp against Team Aqua!"Camp Magma"Egg Hunt!"&Collect Slugma Eggs with Tabitha."Falaise Rocheuse"Grunt work!"GHelp 3 grunts in the Team Magma Camp, then report back to Tabitha!"Anti-Water Training!"8Fuse Numel to make it resistant Water-type attacks."Painting the Town Red"uTeam Aqua painted their logo on various walls in Slateport City. Cover them up with the Team Magma logo instead!"The Magma Theme Song"?Help compose lyrics to the official Team Magma theme song!"2Defend the Team Aqua Camp against Team Magma!"Aqua Camp"%Collect Wailmer Eggs for Shelly."Route 108"EHelp 3 grunts in the Team Aqua Camp, then report back to Shelly!"^You were given two Zubats and a Geodude. Fuse all three of them into Water-type Pokémon."Painting the Town Blue"uTeam Magma painted their logo on various walls in Slateport City. Cover them up with the Team Aqua logo instead!"The Aqua Theme Song">Help compose lyrics to the official Team Aqua theme song!"Cycling Road Time Trial"_Go through the Cycling Road as fast as possible. You'll be penalized if you hit the walls!"Route 110"$Associate Producer! - Episode 1"|You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 2 quests to help write the second season of the show."Mauville TV"$Associate Producer! - Episode 2"|You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 5 quests to help write the second season of the show."$Associate Producer! - Episode 3"}You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 10 quests to help write the second season of the show."$Associate Producer! - Episode 4"}You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 15 quests to help write the second season of the show."$Associate Producer! - Episode 5"}You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 20 quests to help write the second season of the show."$Associate Producer! - Episode 6"}You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 25 quests to help write the second season of the show."$Associate Producer! - Episode 7"}You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 30 quests to help write the second season of the show."L'Élément de Surprise!"eAttraper un Anchwatt dans les eaux près de New Lavandia pour prendre la Team Aqua par surprise."fAttraper un Anchwatt dans les eaux près de New Lavandia pour prendre la Team Magma par surprise."La Famille Stratège"JDefeat all 4 members of the Winstrate family in back-to-back battles."Route 111"A Lost Shroomish">A girl lost her Shroomish and needs your help to find it."Vergazon"The Bored Nurse"oThe Pokémon Center's nurse challenged you to a battle. Meet her in the meadow behind the Pokémon Center."Uproar in B Flat"LA trumpet player is cornered in Rusturf Tunnel. Find a way to help him!"Tunnel Mérazon"The Trumpet Festival!"QFind the 4 Trumpet Brothers and join the Trumpet Festival in Evergrande City"Éternara"Aucune quête terminée"No ongoing main quests"No side quests"Aucune quête à {1}"Journal de quêtes"L/R : MAP"Terminée"Non terminée"\C[{1}]NOUVELLE MISSION:"Sales bestioles"uLe Capitaine de la Team Rocket t'a chargé de nettoyer l'infestation d'insectes au QG temporaire de Céladopole."Zone sans pêche"NIntimide les pêcheurs du Pont Pépite jusqu'à ce qu'ils déguerpissent."Pokémon désobéissant"DRamène le Pokémon du Capitaine KO pour lui donner une leçon."Vol de Pokémon?!":Suis Petrel et vole un Pokémon rare à une fillette.",Approvisionnement des nouvelles recrues"DAttrape 4 Pokémon avec des Rocket Balls autour de Céladopole."!Release this #{pokemon.name}"`Intercepte la livraison de CT au magasin de Céladopole 